<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:07.200" end="00:00:12.639" style="s2">Male applicants only.</p>
<p begin="00:00:09.920" end="00:00:15.040" style="s2">Ethan doesn&#39;t want women around him.</p>
<p begin="00:00:12.639" end="00:00:16.960" style="s2">That won&#39;t be a problem.</p>
<p begin="00:00:15.040" end="00:00:18.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:00:16.960" end="00:00:20.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re the only applicant who passed.</p>
<p begin="00:00:18.720" end="00:00:21.760" style="s2">Manage his schedule. Keep his admires at</p>
<p begin="00:00:20.960" end="00:00:23.840" style="s2">a distance.</p>
<p begin="00:00:21.760" end="00:00:26.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Three jobs and we&#39;re still in debt. I</p>
<p begin="00:00:23.840" end="00:00:28.320" style="s2">need this one. Alex Morgan, your new</p>
<p begin="00:00:26.160" end="00:00:30.000" style="s2">assistant. H.</p>
<p begin="00:00:28.320" end="00:00:33.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your room&#39;s ready.</p>
<p begin="00:00:30.000" end="00:00:33.240" style="s2">Get changed.</p>
<p begin="00:00:39.040" end="00:00:43.360" style="s2">Finished.</p>
<p begin="00:00:41.840" end="00:00:44.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sorry, I was just</p>
<p begin="00:00:43.360" end="00:00:48.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t apologize when you haven&#39;t done</p>
<p begin="00:00:44.960" end="00:00:48.280" style="s2">anything wrong.</p>
<p begin="00:00:48.879" end="00:00:53.520" style="s2">Use this. I don&#39;t want my room smelling</p>
<p begin="00:00:51.200" end="00:00:54.800" style="s2">like sweat.</p>
<p begin="00:00:53.520" end="00:00:56.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your room.</p>
<p begin="00:00:54.800" end="00:00:59.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We leave for campus tomorrow. You&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:00:56.960" end="00:01:02.640" style="s2">sharing mine.</p>
<p begin="00:00:59.120" end="00:01:03.920" style="s2">We have to share. I&#39;m your assistant.</p>
<p begin="00:01:02.640" end="00:01:05.600" style="s2">I could stay somewhere else.</p>
<p begin="00:01:03.920" end="00:01:07.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Two guys, one room. What&#39;s the problem?</p>
<p begin="00:01:05.600" end="00:01:10.479" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Holy Is he into guys? Oh my god.</p>
<p begin="00:01:07.840" end="00:01:14.439" style="s2">No wonder he only hires men.</p>
<p begin="00:01:10.479" end="00:01:14.439" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ethan, over here.</p>
<p begin="00:01:14.560" end="00:01:20.159" style="s2">I&#39;m trying to keep them off you.</p>
<p begin="00:01:17.280" end="00:01:23.479" style="s2">Get on my back. I&#39;ll get you out.</p>
<p begin="00:01:20.159" end="00:01:23.479" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;d collapse.</p>
<p begin="00:01:23.759" end="00:01:28.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If I die saving you, send the payout to</p>
<p begin="00:01:26.240" end="00:01:30.240" style="s2">this account.</p>
<p begin="00:01:28.320" end="00:01:32.720" style="s2">Unbelievable.</p>
<p begin="00:01:30.240" end="00:01:38.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go. I&#39;ll hold them off.</p>
<p begin="00:01:32.720" end="00:01:38.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait, who&#39;s your friend? He&#39;s cute. Me?</p>
<p begin="00:01:41.600" end="00:01:46.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Which bed is yours?</p>
<p begin="00:01:43.040" end="00:01:46.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That one?</p>
<p begin="00:01:47.040" end="00:01:49.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why are you clutching your shirt?</p>
<p begin="00:01:48.731" end="00:01:51.439" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:01:49.360" end="00:01:53.600" style="s2">Aren&#39;t you hot?</p>
<p begin="00:01:51.439" end="00:01:56.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not.</p>
<p begin="00:01:53.600" end="00:01:58.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You act like you&#39;re hiding something.</p>
<p begin="00:01:56.000" end="00:02:00.640" style="s2">What? Are you a girl?</p>
<p begin="00:01:58.240" end="00:02:02.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m a guy, obviously.</p>
<p begin="00:02:00.640" end="00:02:06.759" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then change. We&#39;re both guys. It&#39;s just</p>
<p begin="00:02:02.799" end="00:02:06.759" style="s2">a shirt. Fine.</p>
<p begin="00:02:09.039" end="00:02:12.239" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you want to wear tomorrow?</p>
<p begin="00:02:10.879" end="00:02:14.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Whatever.</p>
<p begin="00:02:12.239" end="00:02:16.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And for breakfast?</p>
<p begin="00:02:14.720" end="00:02:18.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Whatever.</p>
<p begin="00:02:16.560" end="00:02:20.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did I do something wrong?</p>
<p begin="00:02:18.720" end="00:02:22.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stay there.</p>
<p begin="00:02:20.800" end="00:02:26.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Am I getting fired?</p>
<p begin="00:02:22.080" end="00:02:26.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. Unpack. I&#39;m going out.</p>
<p begin="00:02:28.000" end="00:02:32.160" style="s2">Where&#39;s my brother? You lost him</p>
<p begin="00:02:30.239" end="00:02:34.879" style="s2">already? He told me to stay here and</p>
<p begin="00:02:32.160" end="00:02:37.760" style="s2">unpack and you listened. You&#39;re supposed</p>
<p begin="00:02:34.879" end="00:02:40.560" style="s2">to keep track of him.</p>
<p begin="00:02:37.760" end="00:02:42.400" style="s2">What&#39;s your name? Alex Morgan. I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:02:40.560" end="00:02:44.319" style="s2">terrible with names. You&#39;ll be Hey, can</p>
<p begin="00:02:42.400" end="00:02:47.319" style="s2">I get you something? Fresh orange juice.</p>
<p begin="00:02:44.319" end="00:02:47.319" style="s2">Ice.</p>
<p begin="00:02:48.080" end="00:02:53.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No pulp. What is that?</p>
<p begin="00:02:50.959" end="00:02:55.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You didn&#39;t say no pulp. I shouldn&#39;t have</p>
<p begin="00:02:53.200" end="00:02:58.319" style="s2">to. How are you supposed to look after</p>
<p begin="00:02:55.760" end="00:03:00.640" style="s2">Ethan? What was that old man thinking?</p>
<p begin="00:02:58.319" end="00:03:04.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Bennett, start by listening.</p>
<p begin="00:03:00.640" end="00:03:04.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay, I&#39;m listening.</p>
<p begin="00:03:05.440" end="00:03:10.239" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ow. I&#39;m so sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:03:07.680" end="00:03:11.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chloe Sterling. Who ruined your day this</p>
<p begin="00:03:10.239" end="00:03:13.680" style="s2">time?</p>
<p begin="00:03:11.599" end="00:03:17.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Didn&#39;t anyone teach you manners at home?</p>
<p begin="00:03:13.680" end="00:03:21.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who are you? Nobody worth remembering.</p>
<p begin="00:03:17.040" end="00:03:23.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ouch. Missed you too, Chloe.</p>
<p begin="00:03:21.200" end="00:03:25.519" style="s2">Why is everyone in my room? Ethan, there</p>
<p begin="00:03:23.920" end="00:03:28.480" style="s2">you are.</p>
<p begin="00:03:25.519" end="00:03:32.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I told you. Don&#39;t crowd me. [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:03:28.480" end="00:03:36.152" style="s2">See, it&#39;s not personal. He likes me.</p>
<p begin="00:03:32.400" end="00:03:37.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hand off. That goes for you, too.</p>
<p begin="00:03:36.152" end="00:03:39.280" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:03:37.280" end="00:03:40.400" style="s2">No girls, no guys.</p>
<p begin="00:03:39.280" end="00:03:43.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Guess you&#39;re not special either.</p>
<p begin="00:03:40.400" end="00:03:46.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Didn&#39;t anyone teach you manners at home?</p>
<p begin="00:03:43.920" end="00:03:49.879" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That came out wrong. I&#39;m sorry. I take</p>
<p begin="00:03:46.720" end="00:03:49.879" style="s2">it back.</p>
<p begin="00:03:50.239" end="00:03:53.519" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What is it about this tutor? Why is</p>
<p begin="00:03:52.400" end="00:03:57.200" style="s2">everyone so pissed off?</p>
<p begin="00:03:53.519" end="00:03:59.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chloe, back to your dorm.</p>
<p begin="00:03:57.200" end="00:04:01.120" style="s2">You&#39;re my assistant, not a coat rack.</p>
<p begin="00:03:59.760" end="00:04:02.239" style="s2">Relax.</p>
<p begin="00:04:01.120" end="00:04:04.239" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you need anything?</p>
<p begin="00:04:02.239" end="00:04:06.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When you&#39;re off duty, do your own thing.</p>
<p begin="00:04:04.239" end="00:04:08.480" style="s2">I don&#39;t own you. [sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:04:06.720" end="00:04:08.959" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Could I use half the balcony for my</p>
<p begin="00:04:08.480" end="00:04:11.959" style="s2">stuff?</p>
<p begin="00:04:08.959" end="00:04:11.959" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine.</p>
<p begin="00:04:14.142" end="00:04:21.400" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:04:15.920" end="00:04:21.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You cooked? I fell asleep. I&#39;m sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:04:22.000" end="00:04:26.759" style="s2">That&#39;s for me.</p>
<p begin="00:04:23.120" end="00:04:26.759" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Relax. Help yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:04:29.040" end="00:04:33.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Been a while since you had meat.</p>
<p begin="00:04:34.160" end="00:04:37.199" style="s2">With those faces you pull, you should</p>
<p begin="00:04:35.840" end="00:04:39.199" style="s2">major in drama.</p>
<p begin="00:04:37.199" end="00:04:40.479" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why don&#39;t you? You&#39;ve definitely got the</p>
<p begin="00:04:39.199" end="00:04:42.560" style="s2">face for it.</p>
<p begin="00:04:40.479" end="00:04:44.479" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Say that again and you&#39;re Say that</p>
<p begin="00:04:42.560" end="00:04:46.560" style="s2">again and you&#39;re fired.</p>
<p begin="00:04:44.479" end="00:04:48.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I said the wrong thing again. This guy&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:04:46.560" end="00:04:51.199" style="s2">impossible.</p>
<p begin="00:04:48.080" end="00:04:52.960" style="s2">Eleanor Vale is returning to acting.</p>
<p begin="00:04:51.199" end="00:04:54.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; TV&#39;s broken. Go to sleep.</p>
<p begin="00:04:52.960" end="00:04:58.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Spoiled little brat. If I didn&#39;t need</p>
<p begin="00:04:54.960" end="00:04:58.120" style="s2">the money.</p>
<p begin="00:04:58.800" end="00:05:05.759" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you. I&#39;m Zoe. Call me sometime.</p>
<p begin="00:05:03.280" end="00:05:07.759" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You smell like her perfume. Go shower.</p>
<p begin="00:05:05.759" end="00:05:11.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We have class.</p>
<p begin="00:05:07.759" end="00:05:11.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then stay away from me.</p>
<p begin="00:05:14.400" end="00:05:19.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We need to get through. Give him some</p>
<p begin="00:05:16.560" end="00:05:21.039" style="s2">room, please. What&#39;s your name?</p>
<p begin="00:05:19.280" end="00:05:23.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Alex.</p>
<p begin="00:05:21.039" end="00:05:24.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Working for him must suck. Want a new</p>
<p begin="00:05:23.199" end="00:05:25.919" style="s2">boss?</p>
<p begin="00:05:24.080" end="00:05:28.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m happy here.</p>
<p begin="00:05:25.919" end="00:05:30.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re meeting some girls tonight. Need</p>
<p begin="00:05:28.160" end="00:05:33.120" style="s2">one more guy. You in? My assistant isn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:05:30.800" end="00:05:36.880" style="s2">yours to borrow.</p>
<p begin="00:05:33.120" end="00:05:38.960" style="s2">He can answer for himself. Back off. You</p>
<p begin="00:05:36.880" end="00:05:41.120" style="s2">of perfume, too.</p>
<p begin="00:05:38.960" end="00:05:43.280" style="s2">Keep it up. I&#39;ll tell everyone your</p>
<p begin="00:05:41.120" end="00:05:47.520" style="s2">little secret.</p>
<p begin="00:05:43.280" end="00:05:50.000" style="s2">I like looking at models in magazines.</p>
<p begin="00:05:47.520" end="00:05:51.759" style="s2">Actual dating. Not interested. Give me</p>
<p begin="00:05:50.000" end="00:05:54.639" style="s2">space.</p>
<p begin="00:05:51.759" end="00:05:56.479" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wow. You told everyone so I couldn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:05:54.639" end="00:05:59.600" style="s2">hold it over you.</p>
<p begin="00:05:56.479" end="00:06:01.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enough. Nate, apologize. You&#39;re his</p>
<p begin="00:05:59.600" end="00:06:01.919" style="s2">friend. Why would you embarrass him like</p>
<p begin="00:06:01.440" end="00:06:05.199" style="s2">that?</p>
<p begin="00:06:01.919" end="00:06:06.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Alex Morgan got a sister, a cousin who</p>
<p begin="00:06:05.199" end="00:06:08.169" style="s2">looks like you?</p>
<p begin="00:06:06.080" end="00:06:08.169" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:06:09.039" end="00:06:12.479" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay. Sorry, Ethan. Your assistant&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:06:11.759" end="00:06:14.800" style="s2">scary.</p>
<p begin="00:06:12.479" end="00:06:15.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You should smile more. It looks good on</p>
<p begin="00:06:14.800" end="00:06:17.039" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:06:15.120" end="00:06:19.904" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you flirting with me?</p>
<p begin="00:06:17.039" end="00:06:21.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, of course not, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:06:19.904" end="00:06:25.799" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:06:21.600" end="00:06:27.819" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shower. You still smell like perfume.</p>
<p begin="00:06:25.799" end="00:06:27.819" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:06:29.039" end="00:06:33.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I need the bathroom. Can I come in?</p>
<p begin="00:06:32.000" end="00:06:38.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. Give me a minute.</p>
<p begin="00:06:33.840" end="00:06:38.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re both guys. What&#39;s the big deal?</p>
<p begin="00:06:39.919" end="00:06:44.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Alex, you okay?</p>
<p begin="00:06:41.680" end="00:06:47.414" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s cool down here. I got hot.</p>
<p begin="00:06:44.720" end="00:06:47.919" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your skin&#39;s different from mine.</p>
<p begin="00:06:47.414" end="00:06:50.319" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:06:47.919" end="00:06:53.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t. Even if no one&#39;s watching.</p>
<p begin="00:06:50.319" end="00:06:54.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sorry, that was out of line.</p>
<p begin="00:06:53.120" end="00:06:57.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you sick?</p>
<p begin="00:06:54.240" end="00:06:58.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t come over. I&#39;m sleeping.</p>
<p begin="00:06:57.520" end="00:07:01.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s noon.</p>
<p begin="00:06:58.400" end="00:07:01.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s a nap.</p>
<p begin="00:07:02.560" end="00:07:06.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What happened? Are you hurt? Sorry, I I</p>
<p begin="00:07:05.199" end="00:07:08.639" style="s2">dropped a glass.</p>
<p begin="00:07:06.720" end="00:07:10.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is that the only word you know?</p>
<p begin="00:07:08.639" end="00:07:13.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine, you&#39;re up. Let&#39;s eat.</p>
<p begin="00:07:10.880" end="00:07:17.759" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine.</p>
<p begin="00:07:13.440" end="00:07:20.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, my sister&#39;s here. Sit with us.</p>
<p begin="00:07:17.759" end="00:07:22.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ethan, your fiance&#39;s over here. Keep</p>
<p begin="00:07:20.800" end="00:07:25.280" style="s2">your voice down.</p>
<p begin="00:07:22.560" end="00:07:27.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re Ethan&#39;s new assistant. I&#39;m Lena</p>
<p begin="00:07:25.280" end="00:07:29.919" style="s2">Brooks. Alex Morgan. Nice. Take good</p>
<p begin="00:07:27.520" end="00:07:33.360" style="s2">care of him for me.</p>
<p begin="00:07:29.919" end="00:07:35.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Aren&#39;t you getting lunch?</p>
<p begin="00:07:33.360" end="00:07:37.520" style="s2">Hey, come sit with us.</p>
<p begin="00:07:35.360" end="00:07:39.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thanks, but I&#39;m working. I should get</p>
<p begin="00:07:37.520" end="00:07:41.759" style="s2">back to him.</p>
<p begin="00:07:39.520" end="00:07:43.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Keep looking at me like that and I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:07:41.759" end="00:07:45.919" style="s2">think you&#39;re interested.</p>
<p begin="00:07:43.199" end="00:07:48.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enough. Leave my assistant alone.</p>
<p begin="00:07:45.919" end="00:07:51.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s kidding. Our families go way back.</p>
<p begin="00:07:48.560" end="00:07:54.560" style="s2">You can relax around us.</p>
<p begin="00:07:51.440" end="00:07:55.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ethan, slow down. I can&#39;t keep up.</p>
<p begin="00:07:54.560" end="00:07:58.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Am I annoying you?</p>
<p begin="00:07:55.840" end="00:08:02.479" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, I just hadn&#39;t finished eating.</p>
<p begin="00:07:58.639" end="00:08:04.319" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You had plenty of time to talk.</p>
<p begin="00:08:02.479" end="00:08:06.400" style="s2">Why are you mad at me?</p>
<p begin="00:08:04.319" end="00:08:08.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re my assistant. Do you have to be</p>
<p begin="00:08:06.400" end="00:08:11.680" style="s2">the center of attention?</p>
<p begin="00:08:08.800" end="00:08:15.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you want me to say?</p>
<p begin="00:08:11.680" end="00:08:17.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Forget it. Let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="00:08:15.199" end="00:08:19.919" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you don&#39;t need me, can I go to the</p>
<p begin="00:08:17.280" end="00:08:23.400" style="s2">library? I want to study.</p>
<p begin="00:08:19.919" end="00:08:23.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Be back tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:08:29.680" end="00:08:33.120" style="s2">What are you doing down there? Keep</p>
<p begin="00:08:31.120" end="00:08:34.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; your voice down. Just stand in front of</p>
<p begin="00:08:33.120" end="00:08:37.039" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="00:08:34.640" end="00:08:38.765" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you hurt? Let me see.</p>
<p begin="00:08:37.039" end="00:08:40.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No,</p>
<p begin="00:08:38.765" end="00:08:45.320" style="s2">[clears throat] just help me get out of</p>
<p begin="00:08:40.000" end="00:08:45.320" style="s2">here. Help me or I&#39;m not letting go.</p>
<p begin="00:08:45.839" end="00:08:49.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why let them bother you? You put up with</p>
<p begin="00:08:48.320" end="00:08:51.360" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="00:08:49.440" end="00:08:53.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re my boss.</p>
<p begin="00:08:51.360" end="00:08:55.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And if I weren&#39;t,</p>
<p begin="00:08:53.680" end="00:08:57.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; you&#39;re too close.</p>
<p begin="00:08:55.200" end="00:08:59.760" style="s2">Is that Sterling? Is he dating his</p>
<p begin="00:08:57.600" end="00:09:01.760" style="s2">assistant?</p>
<p begin="00:08:59.760" end="00:09:03.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They think we&#39;re dating.</p>
<p begin="00:09:01.760" end="00:09:05.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good.</p>
<p begin="00:09:03.760" end="00:09:07.680" style="s2">Maybe they&#39;ll leave me alone.</p>
<p begin="00:09:05.440" end="00:09:12.519" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re not going to tell them.</p>
<p begin="00:09:07.680" end="00:09:12.519" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You wanted to hide. Stay close.</p>
<p begin="00:09:13.481" end="00:09:16.480" style="s2">[sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:09:14.480" end="00:09:18.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What now? Did I do something?</p>
<p begin="00:09:16.480" end="00:09:20.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not used to this. [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:09:18.240" end="00:09:23.880" style="s2">Stop looking at me like that. I&#39;m not</p>
<p begin="00:09:20.560" end="00:09:23.880" style="s2">into guys.</p>
<p begin="00:09:25.040" end="00:09:30.320" style="s2">My face bothers you. Fine,</p>
<p begin="00:09:28.160" end="00:09:33.519" style="s2">I&#39;ll cover it.</p>
<p begin="00:09:30.320" end="00:09:35.519" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just clean the room.</p>
<p begin="00:09:33.519" end="00:09:37.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Turn it off. Use a broom.</p>
<p begin="00:09:35.519" end="00:09:40.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:09:37.440" end="00:09:41.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Now you&#39;re ignoring me. Talking back.</p>
<p begin="00:09:40.320" end="00:09:44.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You told me to clean.</p>
<p begin="00:09:41.760" end="00:09:45.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If I say you&#39;re talking back, you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:09:44.800" end="00:09:47.040" style="s2">talking back.</p>
<p begin="00:09:45.920" end="00:09:48.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re impossible.</p>
<p begin="00:09:47.040" end="00:09:52.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What did you say?</p>
<p begin="00:09:48.720" end="00:09:55.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have a job to do. Let go. Let go. You</p>
<p begin="00:09:52.800" end="00:09:57.440" style="s2">let go.</p>
<p begin="00:09:55.120" end="00:09:58.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Weren&#39;t you going to study? Leave the</p>
<p begin="00:09:57.440" end="00:10:00.800" style="s2">cleaning to me.</p>
<p begin="00:09:58.560" end="00:10:03.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A little exercise won&#39;t kill me.</p>
<p begin="00:10:00.800" end="00:10:07.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m trying to do my job,</p>
<p begin="00:10:03.680" end="00:10:07.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; so do it. Oh,</p>
<p begin="00:10:09.440" end="00:10:13.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; get off me.</p>
<p begin="00:10:15.279" end="00:10:20.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait, what&#39;s that under your shirt?</p>
<p begin="00:10:17.600" end="00:10:22.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nothing. Get up.</p>
<p begin="00:10:20.480" end="00:10:25.120" style="s2">Why is your chest wrapped up?</p>
<p begin="00:10:22.800" end="00:10:27.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s gauze. I got hurt at work.</p>
<p begin="00:10:25.120" end="00:10:30.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When?</p>
<p begin="00:10:27.120" end="00:10:33.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A while ago. I had three jobs. It</p>
<p begin="00:10:30.640" end="00:10:34.800" style="s2">happened at one of them. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:10:33.440" end="00:10:36.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And you&#39;re still wearing it?</p>
<p begin="00:10:34.800" end="00:10:40.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s an old injury.</p>
<p begin="00:10:36.480" end="00:10:43.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then why don&#39;t I smell any ointment?</p>
<p begin="00:10:40.480" end="00:10:45.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s a scar. It&#39;s ugly. The injury&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:10:43.360" end="00:10:46.640" style="s2">healed. I cover it. I don&#39;t use</p>
<p begin="00:10:45.600" end="00:10:48.720" style="s2">ointment.</p>
<p begin="00:10:46.640" end="00:10:50.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nothing happened. Forget that awful</p>
<p begin="00:10:48.720" end="00:10:51.600" style="s2">kiss,</p>
<p begin="00:10:50.000" end="00:10:53.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; right?</p>
<p begin="00:10:51.600" end="00:10:53.839" style="s2">Sorry someone like me touched your</p>
<p begin="00:10:53.040" end="00:10:56.399" style="s2">precious lips.</p>
<p begin="00:10:53.839" end="00:10:57.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s not what I meant.</p>
<p begin="00:10:56.399" end="00:11:01.040" style="s2">We&#39;re both guys, so</p>
<p begin="00:10:57.920" end="00:11:02.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll clean the bathroom.</p>
<p begin="00:11:01.040" end="00:11:04.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why aren&#39;t you two talking?</p>
<p begin="00:11:02.480" end="00:11:06.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Still worried about that dating rumor.</p>
<p begin="00:11:04.800" end="00:11:08.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nate, I&#39;m eating.</p>
<p begin="00:11:06.320" end="00:11:12.037" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They look like a couple to me.</p>
<p begin="00:11:08.480" end="00:11:12.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Leela, you okay? Ethan, say something.</p>
<p begin="00:11:12.037" end="00:11:15.360" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:11:12.640" end="00:11:17.200" style="s2">Have some water. It might help.</p>
<p begin="00:11:15.360" end="00:11:19.760" style="s2">Thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:11:17.200" end="00:11:21.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Slow down. Mind your manners. If you</p>
<p begin="00:11:19.760" end="00:11:24.000" style="s2">don&#39;t know how to eat properly, learn.</p>
<p begin="00:11:21.920" end="00:11:26.959" style="s2">You&#39;re embarrassing yourself. [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:11:24.000" end="00:11:29.839" style="s2">Ethan, enough. You don&#39;t get to talk to</p>
<p begin="00:11:26.959" end="00:11:31.760" style="s2">him like that. He&#39;s my assistant. Stay</p>
<p begin="00:11:29.839" end="00:11:35.120" style="s2">out of it. I&#39;m telling you how to treat</p>
<p begin="00:11:31.760" end="00:11:37.440" style="s2">people. I didn&#39;t ask. Back off,</p>
<p begin="00:11:35.120" end="00:11:41.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; please. Everyone&#39;s watching.</p>
<p begin="00:11:37.440" end="00:11:41.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stay out of it.</p>
<p begin="00:11:41.600" end="00:11:45.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s take this outside. Ethan, class</p>
<p begin="00:11:44.000" end="00:11:47.440" style="s2">this afternoon. Your welcome speech</p>
<p begin="00:11:45.600" end="00:11:48.720" style="s2">tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:11:47.440" end="00:11:53.760" style="s2">We need to go.</p>
<p begin="00:11:48.720" end="00:11:55.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine. Another day. I&#39;ll talk as usual.</p>
<p begin="00:11:53.760" end="00:11:57.888" style="s2">What did you say?</p>
<p begin="00:11:55.120" end="00:11:59.908" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop.</p>
<p begin="00:11:57.888" end="00:11:59.908" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:12:00.240" end="00:12:03.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Whose assistant are you?</p>
<p begin="00:12:01.519" end="00:12:05.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yours. I was trying to stop the fight.</p>
<p begin="00:12:03.920" end="00:12:09.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then why&#39;d you jump in front of him?</p>
<p begin="00:12:05.200" end="00:12:09.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I wasn&#39;t taking sides. It hurts.</p>
<p begin="00:12:10.480" end="00:12:14.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where does it hurt?</p>
<p begin="00:12:12.639" end="00:12:15.440" style="s2">You need further assessment at the</p>
<p begin="00:12:14.160" end="00:12:16.079" style="s2">hospital. We need to rule out a</p>
<p begin="00:12:15.440" end="00:12:19.440" style="s2">fracture.</p>
<p begin="00:12:16.079" end="00:12:21.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, I don&#39;t need a hospital. I&#39;m fine.</p>
<p begin="00:12:19.440" end="00:12:23.519" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I hurt you. I&#39;ll pay. You&#39;re going.</p>
<p begin="00:12:21.839" end="00:12:25.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can we wait?</p>
<p begin="00:12:23.519" end="00:12:28.959" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t move him. I&#39;m not finished. Are</p>
<p begin="00:12:25.839" end="00:12:31.519" style="s2">you sleeping enough? Eating regularly?</p>
<p begin="00:12:28.959" end="00:12:33.279" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I try. Please follow up. You still need</p>
<p begin="00:12:31.519" end="00:12:37.200" style="s2">that assessment. What if they find out</p>
<p begin="00:12:33.279" end="00:12:40.440" style="s2">I&#39;m a woman? I will when I have time.</p>
<p begin="00:12:37.200" end="00:12:40.440" style="s2">Thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:12:41.200" end="00:12:44.880" style="s2">I know you didn&#39;t mean to hit me.</p>
<p begin="00:12:43.279" end="00:12:47.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You think I&#39;m going to apologize from</p>
<p begin="00:12:44.880" end="00:12:48.320" style="s2">now on? Don&#39;t smile at anyone unless I</p>
<p begin="00:12:47.680" end="00:12:50.959" style="s2">say so.</p>
<p begin="00:12:48.320" end="00:12:52.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t get to decide who I smile at.</p>
<p begin="00:12:50.959" end="00:12:54.160" style="s2">That&#39;s not my job.</p>
<p begin="00:12:52.000" end="00:12:55.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re my assistant. I don&#39;t share.</p>
<p begin="00:12:54.160" end="00:12:56.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t own me.</p>
<p begin="00:12:55.040" end="00:12:59.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I just I don&#39;t like it.</p>
<p begin="00:12:56.720" end="00:13:00.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then tell me what you want.</p>
<p begin="00:12:59.440" end="00:13:01.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What was that?</p>
<p begin="00:13:00.160" end="00:13:02.959" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I couldn&#39;t stop thinking about that</p>
<p begin="00:13:01.440" end="00:13:04.000" style="s2">first kiss. I thought another one would</p>
<p begin="00:13:02.959" end="00:13:05.760" style="s2">get it out of my system.</p>
<p begin="00:13:04.000" end="00:13:06.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, you get to experiment on me without</p>
<p begin="00:13:05.760" end="00:13:08.639" style="s2">asking? [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:13:06.880" end="00:13:09.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Seems to have worked. I feel nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:13:08.639" end="00:13:13.800" style="s2">Same here.</p>
<p begin="00:13:09.360" end="00:13:13.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thirsty. Want some water?</p>
<p begin="00:13:14.524" end="00:13:18.800" style="s2">[cough]</p>
<p begin="00:13:16.160" end="00:13:20.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We should get to the welcome event.</p>
<p begin="00:13:18.800" end="00:13:21.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Alex, wait for me.</p>
<p begin="00:13:20.160" end="00:13:24.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You called me?</p>
<p begin="00:13:21.040" end="00:13:24.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why would I call you?</p>
<p begin="00:13:25.120" end="00:13:27.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;re still setting up. We can come</p>
<p begin="00:13:26.639" end="00:13:29.040" style="s2">back.</p>
<p begin="00:13:27.040" end="00:13:32.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Need help? He can stay.</p>
<p begin="00:13:29.040" end="00:13:32.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thanks.</p>
<p begin="00:13:34.174" end="00:13:36.639" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:13:34.639" end="00:13:39.519" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Here. You look exhausted.</p>
<p begin="00:13:36.639" end="00:13:39.519" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:13:41.600" end="00:13:44.399" style="s2">Student speakers, please report</p>
<p begin="00:13:43.360" end="00:13:45.279" style="s2">backstage.</p>
<p begin="00:13:44.399" end="00:13:46.619" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know.</p>
<p begin="00:13:45.279" end="00:13:48.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll finish tonight, then I</p>
<p begin="00:13:46.619" end="00:13:51.720" style="s2">[clears throat] quit.</p>
<p begin="00:13:48.399" end="00:13:51.720" style="s2">I&#39;m quitting.</p>
<p begin="00:13:52.000" end="00:13:56.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What did you say?</p>
<p begin="00:13:53.360" end="00:13:59.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I want to quit. I&#39;ve thought about it.</p>
<p begin="00:13:56.000" end="00:14:02.079" style="s2">This job isn&#39;t working for me.</p>
<p begin="00:13:59.760" end="00:14:03.760" style="s2">There&#39;s nothing in writing that says I</p>
<p begin="00:14:02.079" end="00:14:04.959" style="s2">have to stay, right?</p>
<p begin="00:14:03.760" end="00:14:10.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:14:04.959" end="00:14:10.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, I can leave tomorrow? You can.</p>
<p begin="00:14:10.320" end="00:14:17.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right. I&#39;ll pack my things. I&#39;ll be</p>
<p begin="00:14:13.839" end="00:14:17.720" style="s2">out first thing in the morning.</p>
<p begin="00:14:27.040" end="00:14:33.125" style="s2">Finally, some peace and quiet. I can do</p>
<p begin="00:14:30.720" end="00:14:35.920" style="s2">whatever I want. This is better. Alex,</p>
<p begin="00:14:33.125" end="00:14:38.399" style="s2">[snorts] is breakfast ready yet?</p>
<p begin="00:14:35.920" end="00:14:42.000" style="s2">Did they do this to you?</p>
<p begin="00:14:38.399" end="00:14:44.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. An accident. I eat well. I have a</p>
<p begin="00:14:42.000" end="00:14:46.639" style="s2">nice room. Just taking a few days off.</p>
<p begin="00:14:44.399" end="00:14:50.865" style="s2">We still have those debts. I&#39;ll keep</p>
<p begin="00:14:46.639" end="00:14:50.865" style="s2">working. Don&#39;t worry. [sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:14:55.440" end="00:14:58.560" style="s2">Come to the hospital. Something happened</p>
<p begin="00:14:57.680" end="00:15:01.560" style="s2">to your dad.</p>
<p begin="00:14:58.560" end="00:15:01.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad?</p>
<p begin="00:15:03.910" end="00:15:07.600" style="s2">[sighs] His</p>
<p begin="00:15:05.519" end="00:15:09.199" style="s2">boss was drunk. Dad drove him and hit</p>
<p begin="00:15:07.600" end="00:15:10.320" style="s2">someone.</p>
<p begin="00:15:09.199" end="00:15:12.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where&#39;s his boss?</p>
<p begin="00:15:10.320" end="00:15:17.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He won&#39;t help. And he fired your dad.</p>
<p begin="00:15:12.880" end="00:15:17.240" style="s2">Why does dad have to cover everything?</p>
<p begin="00:15:17.839" end="00:15:21.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m sorry, sweetheart. I&#39;ve let you</p>
<p begin="00:15:19.680" end="00:15:23.279" style="s2">down.</p>
<p begin="00:15:21.199" end="00:15:26.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;ll find a way. We&#39;re barely covering</p>
<p begin="00:15:23.279" end="00:15:31.480" style="s2">rent. We&#39;re $7,000 short. I can ask</p>
<p begin="00:15:26.480" end="00:15:31.480" style="s2">Ethan. He can lend us the money.</p>
<p begin="00:15:37.760" end="00:15:40.160" style="s2">Do I know you?</p>
<p begin="00:15:38.639" end="00:15:41.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m your assistant.</p>
<p begin="00:15:40.160" end="00:15:43.279" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My assistant quit.</p>
<p begin="00:15:41.440" end="00:15:45.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I made a mistake. Please give me another</p>
<p begin="00:15:43.279" end="00:15:47.680" style="s2">chance.</p>
<p begin="00:15:45.600" end="00:15:48.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You seem pretty sure. Didn&#39;t even say</p>
<p begin="00:15:47.680" end="00:15:53.279" style="s2">goodbye.</p>
<p begin="00:15:48.480" end="00:15:54.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I regret it. I want my job back.</p>
<p begin="00:15:53.279" end="00:15:57.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is this the right room?</p>
<p begin="00:15:54.480" end="00:15:57.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I redecorated.</p>
<p begin="00:15:59.279" end="00:16:02.399" style="s2">Want something?</p>
<p begin="00:16:02.880" end="00:16:06.240" style="s2">My family&#39;s in trouble. I need a loan.</p>
<p begin="00:16:05.199" end="00:16:07.920" style="s2">I&#39;ll work it off.</p>
<p begin="00:16:06.240" end="00:16:09.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why would I lend money to someone who</p>
<p begin="00:16:07.920" end="00:16:11.120" style="s2">just quit?</p>
<p begin="00:16:09.199" end="00:16:12.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:16:11.120" end="00:16:14.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What would it take?</p>
<p begin="00:16:12.800" end="00:16:19.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Work for me again.</p>
<p begin="00:16:14.880" end="00:16:19.639" style="s2">Sign this and I&#39;ll lend you the money.</p>
<p begin="00:16:23.199" end="00:16:27.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; $30,000 if I leave early. When did you</p>
<p begin="00:16:26.560" end="00:16:31.360" style="s2">write this?</p>
<p begin="00:16:27.600" end="00:16:31.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you signing or not?</p>
<p begin="00:16:32.000" end="00:16:35.320" style="s2">I&#39;ll sign.</p>
<p begin="00:16:35.600" end="00:16:38.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How much?</p>
<p begin="00:16:38.959" end="00:16:41.959" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 10,000.</p>
<p begin="00:16:43.600" end="00:16:51.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When does this end?</p>
<p begin="00:16:45.920" end="00:16:51.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 4 years until I leave this school.</p>
<p begin="00:16:51.279" end="00:16:54.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The end date&#39;s blank. I can make it</p>
<p begin="00:16:53.360" end="00:16:56.639" style="s2">longer.</p>
<p begin="00:16:54.160" end="00:16:58.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Four years is plenty. Can I take this</p>
<p begin="00:16:56.639" end="00:17:00.560" style="s2">home?</p>
<p begin="00:16:58.240" end="00:17:04.079" style="s2">1 hour. If you&#39;re not back, I&#39;ll tell</p>
<p begin="00:17:00.560" end="00:17:07.480" style="s2">the cops you scammed me.</p>
<p begin="00:17:04.079" end="00:17:07.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll be quick.</p>
<p begin="00:17:10.079" end="00:17:14.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where have you been? He said you were</p>
<p begin="00:17:12.079" end="00:17:16.959" style="s2">sick.</p>
<p begin="00:17:14.880" end="00:17:18.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Family stuff.</p>
<p begin="00:17:16.959" end="00:17:22.000" style="s2">As a kid, Ethan caught his mom with</p>
<p begin="00:17:18.640" end="00:17:24.480" style="s2">another man. He told his dad. They</p>
<p begin="00:17:22.000" end="00:17:26.640" style="s2">divorced. She left. After that, he</p>
<p begin="00:17:24.480" end="00:17:29.760" style="s2">stopped letting people close. I think</p>
<p begin="00:17:26.640" end="00:17:32.760" style="s2">he&#39;s scared they&#39;ll leave or hurt him. 1</p>
<p begin="00:17:29.760" end="00:17:32.760" style="s2">hour.</p>
<p begin="00:17:36.559" end="00:17:44.600" style="s2">Ethan lent it to me. I have to go.</p>
<p begin="00:17:39.760" end="00:17:44.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, honey. Thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:17:51.760" end="00:17:58.120" style="s2">I&#39;m sorry, traffic. I&#39;m late. I came</p>
<p begin="00:17:54.320" end="00:17:58.120" style="s2">back as fast as I could.</p>
<p begin="00:17:58.400" end="00:18:01.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know.</p>
<p begin="00:18:04.400" end="00:18:09.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad wants you home this weekend, Ethan.</p>
<p begin="00:18:06.160" end="00:18:09.720" style="s2">I&#39;m talking to you.</p>
<p begin="00:18:10.320" end="00:18:13.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:18:13.360" end="00:18:16.720" style="s2">Thanks.</p>
<p begin="00:18:15.200" end="00:18:19.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Saturday 10:00 in the morning.</p>
<p begin="00:18:16.720" end="00:18:21.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Saturday at 10:00. Got it.</p>
<p begin="00:18:19.520" end="00:18:23.440" style="s2">You&#39;re useful after all. Help me out</p>
<p begin="00:18:21.520" end="00:18:25.520" style="s2">sometimes.</p>
<p begin="00:18:23.440" end="00:18:26.320" style="s2">Sorry. Keeping up with Ethan takes all</p>
<p begin="00:18:25.520" end="00:18:29.280" style="s2">my time.</p>
<p begin="00:18:26.320" end="00:18:31.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s my assistant, not the families.</p>
<p begin="00:18:29.280" end="00:18:34.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What family? There&#39;s just dad and me.</p>
<p begin="00:18:31.520" end="00:18:38.400" style="s2">Who else do you have?</p>
<p begin="00:18:34.720" end="00:18:41.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s get some tea. We can talk inside.</p>
<p begin="00:18:38.400" end="00:18:41.400" style="s2">Fine.</p>
<p begin="00:18:46.720" end="00:18:50.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you have a crush on me?</p>
<p begin="00:18:50.799" end="00:18:55.919" style="s2">Chloe, go back to your room.</p>
<p begin="00:18:53.120" end="00:18:57.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What? I just got here. Everyone says</p>
<p begin="00:18:55.919" end="00:18:59.919" style="s2">you&#39;re dating your assistant. Are you?</p>
<p begin="00:18:57.760" end="00:19:03.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t be ridiculous.</p>
<p begin="00:18:59.919" end="00:19:06.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is something wrong?</p>
<p begin="00:19:03.039" end="00:19:09.799" style="s2">Saturday. Don&#39;t forget.</p>
<p begin="00:19:06.559" end="00:19:09.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I won&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:19:13.120" end="00:19:20.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; While you&#39;re here, scrub my back.</p>
<p begin="00:19:17.280" end="00:19:20.840" style="s2">I don&#39;t know how.</p>
<p begin="00:19:20.880" end="00:19:26.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re my assistant. Figure it out.</p>
<p begin="00:19:24.640" end="00:19:27.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Like this?</p>
<p begin="00:19:26.160" end="00:19:28.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Harder.</p>
<p begin="00:19:27.280" end="00:19:31.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sorry. Did that hurt?</p>
<p begin="00:19:28.640" end="00:19:34.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s fine. Keep going. Alex,</p>
<p begin="00:19:31.840" end="00:19:37.840" style="s2">are you into me?</p>
<p begin="00:19:34.080" end="00:19:40.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. Come on. We&#39;re both guys.</p>
<p begin="00:19:37.840" end="00:19:41.919" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then why don&#39;t you want to touch me?</p>
<p begin="00:19:40.480" end="00:19:43.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Being a guy doesn&#39;t mean I don&#39;t get</p>
<p begin="00:19:41.919" end="00:19:47.039" style="s2">embarrassed or that you can touch me</p>
<p begin="00:19:43.600" end="00:19:47.039" style="s2">whenever you want.</p>
<p begin="00:19:52.480" end="00:19:56.280" style="s2">What&#39;s your schedule today?</p>
<p begin="00:19:56.559" end="00:20:03.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have class.</p>
<p begin="00:19:59.280" end="00:20:05.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s buy clothes. You need some.</p>
<p begin="00:20:03.280" end="00:20:07.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I said I have class.</p>
<p begin="00:20:05.280" end="00:20:11.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ask me if you fall behind. I need you to</p>
<p begin="00:20:07.600" end="00:20:15.480" style="s2">deal with the salespeople.</p>
<p begin="00:20:11.039" end="00:20:15.480" style="s2">Pick what you want. I&#39;m paying.</p>
<p begin="00:20:18.400" end="00:20:22.120" style="s2">Walk beside me.</p>
<p begin="00:20:23.200" end="00:20:27.280" style="s2">You don&#39;t like it here.</p>
<p begin="00:20:25.760" end="00:20:31.679" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, it&#39;s fine.</p>
<p begin="00:20:27.280" end="00:20:35.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stay outside. Keep people back.</p>
<p begin="00:20:31.679" end="00:20:39.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Alex, come in.</p>
<p begin="00:20:35.760" end="00:20:39.000" style="s2">Take these.</p>
<p begin="00:20:41.120" end="00:20:44.960" style="s2">Find me a shirt and a suit.</p>
<p begin="00:20:48.080" end="00:20:50.720" style="s2">Do these up?</p>
<p begin="00:20:49.520" end="00:20:53.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your hands work?</p>
<p begin="00:20:50.720" end="00:20:57.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m tired. You&#39;re my assistant.</p>
<p begin="00:20:53.840" end="00:20:57.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine. Hold still.</p>
<p begin="00:21:03.440" end="00:21:08.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll take it. Find him something for a</p>
<p begin="00:21:05.440" end="00:21:08.760" style="s2">formal dinner.</p>
<p begin="00:21:12.159" end="00:21:18.679" style="s2">Looks good. Anything else?</p>
<p begin="00:21:14.559" end="00:21:18.679" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, this is plenty.</p>
<p begin="00:21:19.679" end="00:21:22.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Swimwear</p>
<p begin="00:21:20.799" end="00:21:24.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; right there.</p>
<p begin="00:21:22.640" end="00:21:25.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We need two swimsuits.</p>
<p begin="00:21:24.159" end="00:21:26.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Two?</p>
<p begin="00:21:25.039" end="00:21:28.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There&#39;s a beach party in Miami. That&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:21:26.799" end="00:21:29.120" style="s2">probably why dad wants me home. Might as</p>
<p begin="00:21:28.240" end="00:21:32.159" style="s2">well be ready.</p>
<p begin="00:21:29.120" end="00:21:35.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How about these?</p>
<p begin="00:21:32.159" end="00:21:39.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What about these shorts? More room.</p>
<p begin="00:21:35.760" end="00:21:42.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Those are good. Two pairs.</p>
<p begin="00:21:39.840" end="00:21:47.000" style="s2">Can I choose? I&#39;m the one wearing it.</p>
<p begin="00:21:42.799" end="00:21:47.000" style="s2">Fine. Try it on first.</p>
<p begin="00:21:54.559" end="00:21:57.960" style="s2">Looks good.</p>
<p begin="00:22:06.559" end="00:22:09.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy.</p>
<p begin="00:22:11.520" end="00:22:17.960" style="s2">I&#39;m your girl guy.</p>
<p begin="00:22:14.480" end="00:22:17.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ethan, wait.</p>
<p begin="00:22:18.835" end="00:22:22.559" style="s2">[crying]</p>
<p begin="00:22:20.559" end="00:22:25.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lost your mom.</p>
<p begin="00:22:22.559" end="00:22:26.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Will you help me find her?</p>
<p begin="00:22:25.280" end="00:22:28.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Does she care about you?</p>
<p begin="00:22:26.799" end="00:22:30.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She says I&#39;m the most important thing in</p>
<p begin="00:22:28.720" end="00:22:34.280" style="s2">her life.</p>
<p begin="00:22:30.400" end="00:22:34.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then why&#39;d she leave you?</p>
<p begin="00:22:37.120" end="00:22:44.000" style="s2">She&#39;s lost. Don&#39;t scare her.</p>
<p begin="00:22:41.440" end="00:22:47.679" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Better she learns now.</p>
<p begin="00:22:44.000" end="00:22:49.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The world isn&#39;t kind.</p>
<p begin="00:22:47.679" end="00:22:52.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your mother left. That doesn&#39;t mean</p>
<p begin="00:22:49.520" end="00:22:57.600" style="s2">every mother abandons her child.</p>
<p begin="00:22:52.720" end="00:23:00.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What did you say? Say it again.</p>
<p begin="00:22:57.600" end="00:23:03.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who said you could dig into my life?</p>
<p begin="00:23:00.400" end="00:23:07.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I wasn&#39;t digging into your life. Let go.</p>
<p begin="00:23:03.760" end="00:23:07.039" style="s2">I can&#39;t breathe.</p>
<p begin="00:23:07.600" end="00:23:11.640" style="s2">Can we still find mommy?</p>
<p begin="00:23:15.200" end="00:23:21.280" style="s2">There you are. [snorts] I&#39;m sorry. I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:23:17.679" end="00:23:23.760" style="s2">so sorry. What happened? I wasn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:23:21.280" end="00:23:26.960" style="s2">thinking straight.</p>
<p begin="00:23:23.760" end="00:23:30.840" style="s2">For a moment, I wanted to leave her.</p>
<p begin="00:23:26.960" end="00:23:30.840" style="s2">Then I came back looking.</p>
<p begin="00:23:32.559" end="00:23:37.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You wanted to leave your child?</p>
<p begin="00:23:35.520" end="00:23:38.640" style="s2">I&#39;m sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:23:37.280" end="00:23:41.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did you think about what that would do</p>
<p begin="00:23:38.640" end="00:23:45.880" style="s2">to her?</p>
<p begin="00:23:41.760" end="00:23:45.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ethan, come with me.</p>
<p begin="00:23:50.559" end="00:23:55.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You think I&#39;m awful, don&#39;t you?</p>
<p begin="00:23:54.159" end="00:23:58.720" style="s2">I shouldn&#39;t have used your past against</p>
<p begin="00:23:55.760" end="00:24:02.080" style="s2">you. You can&#39;t grab me like that.</p>
<p begin="00:23:58.720" end="00:24:04.799" style="s2">Nate told me I wasn&#39;t laughing at you.</p>
<p begin="00:24:02.080" end="00:24:07.039" style="s2">None of it was your fault.</p>
<p begin="00:24:04.799" end="00:24:10.039" style="s2">You know my secret. Tell me one of</p>
<p begin="00:24:07.039" end="00:24:10.039" style="s2">yours.</p>
<p begin="00:24:10.480" end="00:24:16.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can I tell you about my family instead?</p>
<p begin="00:24:13.279" end="00:24:18.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go on.</p>
<p begin="00:24:16.080" end="00:24:20.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tuition was a struggle. I started</p>
<p begin="00:24:18.799" end="00:24:24.720" style="s2">working young. We think about making</p>
<p begin="00:24:20.880" end="00:24:28.679" style="s2">money. You You think about spending it.</p>
<p begin="00:24:24.720" end="00:24:28.679" style="s2">But my parents love me.</p>
<p begin="00:24:30.240" end="00:24:34.159" style="s2">If I&#39;d kept my mouth shut, would I still</p>
<p begin="00:24:33.039" end="00:24:36.799" style="s2">have a mom?</p>
<p begin="00:24:34.159" end="00:24:38.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You give yourself too much credit.</p>
<p begin="00:24:36.799" end="00:24:41.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A kid telling the truth doesn&#39;t destroy</p>
<p begin="00:24:38.640" end="00:24:41.880" style="s2">a marriage.</p>
<p begin="00:24:45.840" end="00:24:51.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You just said that and I&#39;m not even mad.</p>
<p begin="00:24:51.452" end="00:24:53.472" style="s2">[sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:24:54.799" end="00:24:59.919" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s get you checked.</p>
<p begin="00:24:58.000" end="00:25:02.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You wait outside.</p>
<p begin="00:24:59.919" end="00:25:05.400" style="s2">My results are private.</p>
<p begin="00:25:02.400" end="00:25:05.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="00:25:06.320" end="00:25:12.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nothing abnormal showed up today. When</p>
<p begin="00:25:09.279" end="00:25:14.320" style="s2">does your heart race?</p>
<p begin="00:25:12.080" end="00:25:18.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When I&#39;m with one person.</p>
<p begin="00:25:14.320" end="00:25:18.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Someone you care about.</p>
<p begin="00:25:23.440" end="00:25:27.080" style="s2">What did they say?</p>
<p begin="00:25:29.520" end="00:25:33.279" style="s2">Why are you avoiding me? What did the</p>
<p begin="00:25:32.159" end="00:25:36.559" style="s2">doctor say?</p>
<p begin="00:25:33.279" end="00:25:37.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What if I have feelings for someone?</p>
<p begin="00:25:36.559" end="00:25:40.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who?</p>
<p begin="00:25:37.760" end="00:25:42.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not me. A friend. I&#39;m asking for a</p>
<p begin="00:25:40.400" end="00:25:45.760" style="s2">friend. Maybe a romance novel would</p>
<p begin="00:25:42.880" end="00:25:49.799" style="s2">help.</p>
<p begin="00:25:45.760" end="00:25:49.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine, let&#39;s try it.</p>
<p begin="00:25:49.919" end="00:25:54.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Like how he starts treating her better.</p>
<p begin="00:25:53.279" end="00:25:56.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Would you like him if you met him in</p>
<p begin="00:25:54.640" end="00:26:01.240" style="s2">real life?</p>
<p begin="00:25:56.559" end="00:26:01.240" style="s2">It&#39;s a book. Dinner&#39;s ready.</p>
<p begin="00:26:02.799" end="00:26:08.039" style="s2">Your dad invited me and Nate. We&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:26:04.720" end="00:26:08.039" style="s2">coming, too.</p>
<p begin="00:26:12.159" end="00:26:17.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll call a car. Lena can take my seat.</p>
<p begin="00:26:14.480" end="00:26:21.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She has a car.</p>
<p begin="00:26:17.360" end="00:26:21.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s fine. I&#39;ll go on my own.</p>
<p begin="00:26:26.400" end="00:26:30.200" style="s2">Then I&#39;ll wait with you.</p>
<p begin="00:26:30.960" end="00:26:34.998" style="s2">I&#39;ll call a car. You all go. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:26:37.563" end="00:26:39.583" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:26:41.679" end="00:26:48.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chloe, can you help?</p>
<p begin="00:26:45.440" end="00:26:48.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad,</p>
<p begin="00:26:48.480" end="00:26:52.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miami tomorrow. You&#39;re handling things.</p>
<p begin="00:26:50.960" end="00:26:54.240" style="s2">Don&#39;t let me down.</p>
<p begin="00:26:52.000" end="00:26:55.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course, father. Lena, Nate, stay the</p>
<p begin="00:26:54.240" end="00:26:57.919" style="s2">night. You can all leave together</p>
<p begin="00:26:55.360" end="00:26:59.520" style="s2">tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:26:57.919" end="00:27:02.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Sterling asked for his son&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:26:59.520" end="00:27:04.799" style="s2">favorites. Come learn how to make them.</p>
<p begin="00:27:02.880" end="00:27:09.880" style="s2">When he was little, Ethan was always</p>
<p begin="00:27:04.799" end="00:27:09.880" style="s2">laughing. Started seeing that again.</p>
<p begin="00:27:13.840" end="00:27:18.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You learned fast.</p>
<p begin="00:27:15.120" end="00:27:21.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve had practice.</p>
<p begin="00:27:18.320" end="00:27:21.320" style="s2">Anything</p>
<p begin="00:27:28.960" end="00:27:35.720" style="s2">else you need?</p>
<p begin="00:27:30.880" end="00:27:35.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nothing. I don&#39;t need you right now. Go.</p>
<p begin="00:27:40.080" end="00:27:44.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Alex, in here.</p>
<p begin="00:27:47.360" end="00:27:51.634" style="s2">Are you and my brother together? [music]</p>
<p begin="00:27:52.720" end="00:27:58.120" style="s2">No, we&#39;re not together. He slept on your</p>
<p begin="00:27:55.120" end="00:27:58.120" style="s2">shoulder.</p>
<p begin="00:27:58.559" end="00:28:02.640" style="s2">Then date me.</p>
<p begin="00:28:01.039" end="00:28:04.399" style="s2">You</p>
<p begin="00:28:02.640" end="00:28:06.000" style="s2">pretend.</p>
<p begin="00:28:04.399" end="00:28:10.760" style="s2">Let&#39;s see if my brother still claims he</p>
<p begin="00:28:06.000" end="00:28:10.760" style="s2">doesn&#39;t care. You&#39;ll end up fighting.</p>
<p begin="00:28:11.360" end="00:28:15.840" style="s2">He tells me nothing. But you always get</p>
<p begin="00:28:13.600" end="00:28:18.559" style="s2">a reaction. We&#39;ll tell everyone</p>
<p begin="00:28:15.840" end="00:28:18.559" style="s2">tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:28:19.279" end="00:28:22.720" style="s2">Just for show. Keep your hands to</p>
<p begin="00:28:21.200" end="00:28:24.720" style="s2">yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:28:22.720" end="00:28:28.320" style="s2">I don&#39;t think we should. Unless you want</p>
<p begin="00:28:24.720" end="00:28:32.360" style="s2">everyone thinking you&#39;re dating him.</p>
<p begin="00:28:28.320" end="00:28:32.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay, just pretend.</p>
<p begin="00:28:34.320" end="00:28:39.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What were you doing in there?</p>
<p begin="00:28:36.000" end="00:28:39.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just talking.</p>
<p begin="00:28:40.399" end="00:28:45.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Promise you won&#39;t get mad.</p>
<p begin="00:28:42.399" end="00:28:45.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I promise.</p>
<p begin="00:28:45.679" end="00:28:51.239" style="s2">Chloe and I are dating.</p>
<p begin="00:28:49.219" end="00:28:51.239" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:28:52.240" end="00:28:58.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Date her? What&#39;s it to me?</p>
<p begin="00:28:56.000" end="00:29:00.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait, you barely know her. Do you</p>
<p begin="00:28:58.880" end="00:29:02.320" style="s2">actually like her?</p>
<p begin="00:29:00.559" end="00:29:03.679" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Love at first sight. I guess</p>
<p begin="00:29:02.320" end="00:29:05.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; that&#39;s the only reason.</p>
<p begin="00:29:03.679" end="00:29:09.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:29:05.440" end="00:29:09.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t lie to me.</p>
<p begin="00:29:13.760" end="00:29:19.919" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop staring. You&#39;re making it weird.</p>
<p begin="00:29:17.279" end="00:29:23.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s my first flight.</p>
<p begin="00:29:19.919" end="00:29:24.559" style="s2">Alex, there you are.</p>
<p begin="00:29:23.360" end="00:29:27.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s all this?</p>
<p begin="00:29:24.559" end="00:29:27.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s my boyfriend. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:29:30.159" end="00:29:34.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Move. You&#39;re blocking the way.</p>
<p begin="00:29:43.200" end="00:29:50.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Boyfriend. You should be here with me.</p>
<p begin="00:29:48.320" end="00:29:53.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everyone&#39;s showing some skin. Take off</p>
<p begin="00:29:50.320" end="00:29:53.480" style="s2">your shirt.</p>
<p begin="00:29:54.080" end="00:29:58.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Trust me, no muscle&#39;s worth showing.</p>
<p begin="00:30:01.679" end="00:30:08.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll take that. I&#39;ve got it. Back off.</p>
<p begin="00:30:05.520" end="00:30:13.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s your boyfriend. Be nice to him.</p>
<p begin="00:30:08.880" end="00:30:13.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course. Come here, Alex.</p>
<p begin="00:30:15.039" end="00:30:19.120" style="s2">already playing the happy couple.</p>
<p begin="00:30:17.440" end="00:30:22.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jealous</p>
<p begin="00:30:19.120" end="00:30:25.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; of you. Please,</p>
<p begin="00:30:22.080" end="00:30:25.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; let&#39;s go watch the girls.</p>
<p begin="00:30:29.600" end="00:30:33.559" style="s2">Nate&#39;s such an idiot.</p>
<p begin="00:30:34.159" end="00:30:39.039" style="s2">Ethan gave me this when I was little.</p>
<p begin="00:30:36.559" end="00:30:43.520" style="s2">Said it was one of my tears. Whenever I</p>
<p begin="00:30:39.039" end="00:30:43.520" style="s2">was sad, I could talk to it.</p>
<p begin="00:30:43.679" end="00:30:49.141" style="s2">He used to smile all the time.</p>
<p begin="00:30:47.121" end="00:30:49.141" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:30:55.279" end="00:31:02.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s Chloe. Drop the miss.</p>
<p begin="00:30:58.799" end="00:31:02.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You really buy this?</p>
<p begin="00:31:04.080" end="00:31:07.520" style="s2">Where were you?</p>
<p begin="00:31:05.679" end="00:31:11.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Getting some air.</p>
<p begin="00:31:07.520" end="00:31:11.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You couldn&#39;t tell me first.</p>
<p begin="00:31:12.000" end="00:31:17.120" style="s2">He&#39;s my boyfriend, remember?</p>
<p begin="00:31:14.399" end="00:31:18.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s your assistant, too.</p>
<p begin="00:31:17.120" end="00:31:19.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That doesn&#39;t mean we can&#39;t have time</p>
<p begin="00:31:18.399" end="00:31:23.960" style="s2">together.</p>
<p begin="00:31:19.120" end="00:31:23.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine. Do whatever you want.</p>
<p begin="00:31:28.320" end="00:31:34.000" style="s2">This was supposed to make him talk.</p>
<p begin="00:31:31.520" end="00:31:37.240" style="s2">Now he&#39;s mad at me. Then let&#39;s not make</p>
<p begin="00:31:34.000" end="00:31:37.240" style="s2">it worse.</p>
<p begin="00:31:41.200" end="00:31:46.880" style="s2">What were you doing in there?</p>
<p begin="00:31:43.200" end="00:31:48.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She was upset. I was comforting her.</p>
<p begin="00:31:46.880" end="00:31:52.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shouldn&#39;t you talk to the guests? Your</p>
<p begin="00:31:48.480" end="00:31:52.440" style="s2">dad wants you to get to know them.</p>
<p begin="00:32:00.799" end="00:32:03.799" style="s2">Ethan</p>
<p begin="00:32:11.679" end="00:32:14.679" style="s2">Wait.</p>
<p begin="00:32:16.799" end="00:32:19.799" style="s2">Help.</p>
<p begin="00:32:19.919" end="00:32:23.559" style="s2">I can&#39;t swim.</p>
<p begin="00:32:25.600" end="00:32:32.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I got you.</p>
<p begin="00:32:28.559" end="00:32:32.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Alex, look at me.</p>
<p begin="00:32:32.799" end="00:32:35.200" style="s2">Thank God.</p>
<p begin="00:32:33.887" end="00:32:37.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:32:35.200" end="00:32:42.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re okay.</p>
<p begin="00:32:37.600" end="00:32:42.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can&#39;t swim. You almost killed me.</p>
<p begin="00:32:44.399" end="00:32:52.919" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can do it myself. Don&#39;t open my door.</p>
<p begin="00:32:48.960" end="00:32:52.919" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay, I won&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:32:56.720" end="00:32:59.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ethan, the water stopped. Can you pass</p>
<p begin="00:32:58.799" end="00:33:02.799" style="s2">me a towel?</p>
<p begin="00:32:59.760" end="00:33:04.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why are you always scared? I&#39;ll see you.</p>
<p begin="00:33:02.799" end="00:33:05.919" style="s2">maintenance. There&#39;s a water problem</p>
<p begin="00:33:04.159" end="00:33:10.840" style="s2">coming in to check.</p>
<p begin="00:33:05.919" end="00:33:10.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The towel, please. Now,</p>
<p begin="00:33:13.279" end="00:33:20.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I told you not to come in.</p>
<p begin="00:33:17.279" end="00:33:20.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re a woman.</p>
<p begin="00:33:36.000" end="00:33:42.663" style="s2">Where have you been? I fell in.</p>
<p begin="00:33:40.159" end="00:33:43.973" style="s2">Ethan pulled me out.</p>
<p begin="00:33:42.663" end="00:33:45.993" style="s2">[cough]</p>
<p begin="00:33:43.973" end="00:33:45.993" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:33:52.240" end="00:33:56.880" style="s2">We need another room.</p>
<p begin="00:33:54.640" end="00:33:58.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You have four reserved. Everything else</p>
<p begin="00:33:56.880" end="00:34:00.960" style="s2">is booked. [sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:33:58.960" end="00:34:03.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nothing at all.</p>
<p begin="00:34:00.960" end="00:34:06.159" style="s2">I&#39;m sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:34:03.200" end="00:34:08.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You two share a room at school.</p>
<p begin="00:34:06.159" end="00:34:11.960" style="s2">What&#39;s changed?</p>
<p begin="00:34:08.399" end="00:34:11.960" style="s2">I want some space.</p>
<p begin="00:34:18.639" end="00:34:21.919" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What happens now?</p>
<p begin="00:34:20.079" end="00:34:26.119" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We get some sleep.</p>
<p begin="00:34:21.919" end="00:34:26.119" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I mean, are you firing me?</p>
<p begin="00:34:26.240" end="00:34:33.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I lied because I needed the money. Hey,</p>
<p begin="00:34:28.800" end="00:34:33.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I haven&#39;t paid back your loan yet.</p>
<p begin="00:34:34.800" end="00:34:38.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m taking a shower.</p>
<p begin="00:34:42.159" end="00:34:47.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Breakfast</p>
<p begin="00:34:44.000" end="00:34:47.000" style="s2">later.</p>
<p begin="00:34:52.320" end="00:34:58.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Something wrong? You look miserable.</p>
<p begin="00:34:54.879" end="00:34:58.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m fine. Really?</p>
<p begin="00:35:00.000" end="00:35:04.880" style="s2">Alex, I like you</p>
<p begin="00:35:02.960" end="00:35:05.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; and I know you&#39;re a woman.</p>
<p begin="00:35:04.880" end="00:35:09.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How do you know?</p>
<p begin="00:35:05.680" end="00:35:11.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve suspected for a while. Back off.</p>
<p begin="00:35:09.520" end="00:35:14.160" style="s2">You&#39;re the boss. You don&#39;t get to answer</p>
<p begin="00:35:11.839" end="00:35:16.960" style="s2">for Alex.</p>
<p begin="00:35:14.160" end="00:35:21.000" style="s2">I said back off.</p>
<p begin="00:35:16.960" end="00:35:21.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop. Both of you.</p>
<p begin="00:35:25.200" end="00:35:29.119" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why did you kiss me? So he knows he</p>
<p begin="00:35:27.359" end="00:35:30.640" style="s2">can&#39;t touch you.</p>
<p begin="00:35:29.119" end="00:35:34.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then what am I to you?</p>
<p begin="00:35:30.640" end="00:35:34.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Something that belongs to me.</p>
<p begin="00:35:35.440" end="00:35:39.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We need to talk alone.</p>
<p begin="00:35:40.160" end="00:35:44.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You hit on my boyfriend.</p>
<p begin="00:35:41.599" end="00:35:47.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was pushing Ethan to admit it. Alex is</p>
<p begin="00:35:44.160" end="00:35:47.400" style="s2">a woman.</p>
<p begin="00:35:47.760" end="00:35:53.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You pay me to work. You don&#39;t own me.</p>
<p begin="00:35:51.040" end="00:35:55.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you like me?</p>
<p begin="00:35:53.040" end="00:35:57.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Whatever I say, don&#39;t punish me. No</p>
<p begin="00:35:55.200" end="00:36:00.920" style="s2">firing me or demanding your money back.</p>
<p begin="00:35:57.680" end="00:36:00.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I promise.</p>
<p begin="00:36:01.760" end="00:36:06.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, I like you.</p>
<p begin="00:36:04.400" end="00:36:08.079" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But I&#39;m a woman. You hate women.</p>
<p begin="00:36:06.320" end="00:36:10.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t understand it. I don&#39;t hate you.</p>
<p begin="00:36:08.079" end="00:36:12.240" style="s2">I like you. It took you long enough.</p>
<p begin="00:36:10.880" end="00:36:14.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How can I believe you when you talk to</p>
<p begin="00:36:12.240" end="00:36:15.760" style="s2">me like that?</p>
<p begin="00:36:14.400" end="00:36:19.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What should I say?</p>
<p begin="00:36:15.760" end="00:36:22.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 1 month. No snapping at me. No insults.</p>
<p begin="00:36:19.280" end="00:36:25.599" style="s2">Prove we can do this.</p>
<p begin="00:36:22.320" end="00:36:29.690" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s it. Let&#39;s see you do it first.</p>
<p begin="00:36:25.599" end="00:36:30.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay, I&#39;ll do it.</p>
<p begin="00:36:29.690" end="00:36:34.200" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:36:30.320" end="00:36:34.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I should get back to work.</p>
<p begin="00:36:38.079" end="00:36:42.359" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Alex, come with me.</p>
<p begin="00:36:42.720" end="00:36:48.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We need to talk about this.</p>
<p begin="00:36:44.640" end="00:36:50.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Alex Morgan,</p>
<p begin="00:36:48.000" end="00:36:51.359" style="s2">Cole Weston, I&#39;d like to get to know</p>
<p begin="00:36:50.160" end="00:36:54.160" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:36:51.359" end="00:36:56.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sure. Actually,</p>
<p begin="00:36:54.160" end="00:36:58.560" style="s2">I was thinking more than friends.</p>
<p begin="00:36:56.400" end="00:37:00.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve got the wrong person. I&#39;m a guy.</p>
<p begin="00:36:58.560" end="00:37:02.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can fool them, not me.</p>
<p begin="00:37:00.880" end="00:37:04.079" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you want?</p>
<p begin="00:37:02.160" end="00:37:05.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Date me. You don&#39;t want everyone finding</p>
<p begin="00:37:04.079" end="00:37:10.280" style="s2">out you&#39;re a woman, do you?</p>
<p begin="00:37:05.599" end="00:37:10.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. I have somewhere to be.</p>
<p begin="00:37:16.960" end="00:37:21.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sorry, didn&#39;t mean to interrupt.</p>
<p begin="00:37:26.400" end="00:37:31.640" style="s2">Know your place. You and Ethan live in</p>
<p begin="00:37:28.400" end="00:37:31.640" style="s2">different worlds.</p>
<p begin="00:37:36.000" end="00:37:41.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lena had an asthma attack. I held her up</p>
<p begin="00:37:38.400" end="00:37:43.599" style="s2">and loosened her collar. That&#39;s all.</p>
<p begin="00:37:41.280" end="00:37:45.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t owe me an explanation.</p>
<p begin="00:37:43.599" end="00:37:46.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you mad?</p>
<p begin="00:37:45.040" end="00:37:49.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:37:46.880" end="00:37:51.839" style="s2">You&#39;re being</p>
<p begin="00:37:49.200" end="00:37:55.440" style="s2">Nothing happened between us.</p>
<p begin="00:37:51.839" end="00:37:57.359" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This isn&#39;t funny. Explain first.</p>
<p begin="00:37:55.440" end="00:38:00.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Cole Wester&#39;s back from his exchange in</p>
<p begin="00:37:57.359" end="00:38:04.000" style="s2">the UK.</p>
<p begin="00:38:00.160" end="00:38:06.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ethan and I go way back. Show me around.</p>
<p begin="00:38:04.000" end="00:38:09.960" style="s2">No.</p>
<p begin="00:38:06.320" end="00:38:09.960" style="s2">Is that seat free?</p>
<p begin="00:38:11.920" end="00:38:16.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hi. What&#39;s your name?</p>
<p begin="00:38:17.839" end="00:38:24.839" style="s2">Alex Morgan.</p>
<p begin="00:38:21.119" end="00:38:24.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nice to meet you, Alex.</p>
<p begin="00:38:35.280" end="00:38:37.119" style="s2">Stay away from Cole.</p>
<p begin="00:38:36.400" end="00:38:40.079" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He already</p>
<p begin="00:38:37.119" end="00:38:42.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; won&#39;t tell Lena or Chloe he&#39;s back.</p>
<p begin="00:38:40.079" end="00:38:46.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t tell me what.</p>
<p begin="00:38:42.720" end="00:38:46.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s see.</p>
<p begin="00:38:47.680" end="00:38:53.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not here. I&#39;m not ready for everyone</p>
<p begin="00:38:49.760" end="00:38:53.320" style="s2">asking about us.</p>
<p begin="00:38:55.680" end="00:39:00.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s wrong with holding my</p>
<p begin="00:38:56.720" end="00:39:03.839" style="s2">girlfriend&#39;s hand? It&#39;s in the book.</p>
<p begin="00:39:00.640" end="00:39:05.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine. Do you even want to be with me? I</p>
<p begin="00:39:03.839" end="00:39:09.079" style="s2">said not at school. I didn&#39;t say I don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:39:05.920" end="00:39:09.079" style="s2">want you.</p>
<p begin="00:39:18.320" end="00:39:21.680" style="s2">Dating you doesn&#39;t mean I&#39;ve said yes to</p>
<p begin="00:39:20.160" end="00:39:25.560" style="s2">everything.</p>
<p begin="00:39:21.680" end="00:39:25.560" style="s2">You can ask me first.</p>
<p begin="00:39:26.320" end="00:39:32.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can I kiss you?</p>
<p begin="00:39:29.599" end="00:39:32.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:39:40.880" end="00:39:47.079" style="s2">Do you want to keep going?</p>
<p begin="00:39:42.480" end="00:39:47.079" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, I want this.</p>
<p begin="00:39:49.200" end="00:39:51.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you hungry? Want me to cook?</p>
<p begin="00:39:50.720" end="00:39:54.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You do that?</p>
<p begin="00:39:51.599" end="00:39:54.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course.</p>
<p begin="00:39:54.880" end="00:39:58.359" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is good.</p>
<p begin="00:40:06.560" end="00:40:09.440" style="s2">Your birthday&#39;s coming up. How do you</p>
<p begin="00:40:08.000" end="00:40:10.720" style="s2">want to celebrate? I don&#39;t know where to</p>
<p begin="00:40:09.440" end="00:40:12.800" style="s2">start.</p>
<p begin="00:40:10.720" end="00:40:15.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just you and me this year. How about</p>
<p begin="00:40:12.800" end="00:40:15.800" style="s2">skiing?</p>
<p begin="00:40:21.599" end="00:40:26.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Cole&#39;s throwing you a birthday party.</p>
<p begin="00:40:23.359" end="00:40:28.640" style="s2">He&#39;s invited the whole class.</p>
<p begin="00:40:26.400" end="00:40:30.640" style="s2">I never agreed to that. That&#39;s what he&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:40:28.640" end="00:40:33.359" style="s2">counting on now. He just needs you not</p>
<p begin="00:40:30.640" end="00:40:35.920" style="s2">to show up.</p>
<p begin="00:40:33.359" end="00:40:38.800" style="s2">I&#39;m not going.</p>
<p begin="00:40:35.920" end="00:40:42.079" style="s2">He can do what he wants. He invites</p>
<p begin="00:40:38.800" end="00:40:45.040" style="s2">everyone. You don&#39;t show.</p>
<p begin="00:40:42.079" end="00:40:47.839" style="s2">Who looks bad?</p>
<p begin="00:40:45.040" end="00:40:51.720" style="s2">Not my problem. You&#39;re not the only one</p>
<p begin="00:40:47.839" end="00:40:51.720" style="s2">who could run the family business.</p>
<p begin="00:40:53.760" end="00:40:59.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How is Cole related to you? His mom is</p>
<p begin="00:40:57.280" end="00:41:02.720" style="s2">Ethan&#39;s aunt. Ethan&#39;s grandfather</p>
<p begin="00:40:59.839" end="00:41:05.200" style="s2">favored her and left her shares.</p>
<p begin="00:41:02.720" end="00:41:07.760" style="s2">He looks friendly. You keep making</p>
<p begin="00:41:05.200" end="00:41:09.359" style="s2">yourself look difficult.</p>
<p begin="00:41:07.760" end="00:41:12.359" style="s2">I don&#39;t want a crowd of women all over</p>
<p begin="00:41:09.359" end="00:41:12.359" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="00:41:12.640" end="00:41:18.359" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, don&#39;t let him decide how your</p>
<p begin="00:41:15.040" end="00:41:18.359" style="s2">birthday goes.</p>
<p begin="00:41:18.400" end="00:41:23.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You think I should?</p>
<p begin="00:41:21.040" end="00:41:25.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:41:23.599" end="00:41:30.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay, I&#39;ll go.</p>
<p begin="00:41:25.440" end="00:41:30.599" style="s2">You say one word and he listens.</p>
<p begin="00:41:30.993" end="00:41:34.880" style="s2">[sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:41:32.079" end="00:41:37.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Someone cares about me, too.</p>
<p begin="00:41:34.880" end="00:41:37.880" style="s2">Who?</p>
<p begin="00:41:39.599" end="00:41:44.119" style="s2">Chloe. We&#39;re dating.</p>
<p begin="00:41:47.280" end="00:41:50.800" style="s2">My sister. I&#39;ve liked her for a long</p>
<p begin="00:41:49.280" end="00:41:52.480" style="s2">time.</p>
<p begin="00:41:50.800" end="00:41:54.000" style="s2">She got jealous when I pretended to like</p>
<p begin="00:41:52.480" end="00:41:57.760" style="s2">Alex.</p>
<p begin="00:41:54.000" end="00:42:01.200" style="s2">I finally told her how I felt.</p>
<p begin="00:41:57.760" end="00:42:04.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you serious about her? I am. I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:42:01.200" end="00:42:04.599" style="s2">treat her right.</p>
<p begin="00:42:12.480" end="00:42:17.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss that. Borrow my notes.</p>
<p begin="00:42:22.480" end="00:42:24.560" style="s2">Can I go out for a bit?</p>
<p begin="00:42:23.839" end="00:42:29.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll come.</p>
<p begin="00:42:24.560" end="00:42:29.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, just me, please.</p>
<p begin="00:42:31.680" end="00:42:38.319" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fancy seeing you here.</p>
<p begin="00:42:35.599" end="00:42:42.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I need a yarn store.</p>
<p begin="00:42:38.319" end="00:42:42.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Me, too. I know one.</p>
<p begin="00:42:48.160" end="00:42:52.480" style="s2">Your favorite color?</p>
<p begin="00:42:50.079" end="00:42:54.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Blue.</p>
<p begin="00:42:52.480" end="00:42:57.119" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll knit something blue for someone I</p>
<p begin="00:42:54.160" end="00:43:00.079" style="s2">like.</p>
<p begin="00:42:57.119" end="00:43:03.800" style="s2">Ethan&#39;s used to the best. What if he</p>
<p begin="00:43:00.079" end="00:43:03.800" style="s2">doesn&#39;t like a cheap gift?</p>
<p begin="00:43:06.800" end="00:43:10.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll pay for mine.</p>
<p begin="00:43:16.880" end="00:43:20.720" style="s2">Why were you with Cole?</p>
<p begin="00:43:19.724" end="00:43:22.560" style="s2">[sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:43:20.720" end="00:43:24.319" style="s2">We ended up sharing a cab. I went</p>
<p begin="00:43:22.560" end="00:43:26.000" style="s2">shopping</p>
<p begin="00:43:24.319" end="00:43:28.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; for what?</p>
<p begin="00:43:26.000" end="00:43:31.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can&#39;t tell you yet. Why is this so</p>
<p begin="00:43:28.800" end="00:43:31.800" style="s2">hard?</p>
<p begin="00:43:42.960" end="00:43:47.319" style="s2">My father&#39;s birthday gift to you.</p>
<p begin="00:43:56.560" end="00:44:00.119" style="s2">Why aren&#39;t you inside?</p>
<p begin="00:44:00.480" end="00:44:06.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I told you it&#39;s for someone I like.</p>
<p begin="00:44:04.079" end="00:44:08.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m sorry. I can&#39;t date you. We barely</p>
<p begin="00:44:06.880" end="00:44:10.319" style="s2">know each other. Why won&#39;t you leave me</p>
<p begin="00:44:08.240" end="00:44:12.640" style="s2">alone?</p>
<p begin="00:44:10.319" end="00:44:14.079" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you sure we&#39;ve never met before? I</p>
<p begin="00:44:12.640" end="00:44:15.280" style="s2">met you first. You really don&#39;t remember</p>
<p begin="00:44:14.079" end="00:44:18.319" style="s2">when we were kids?</p>
<p begin="00:44:15.280" end="00:44:22.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What happened when we were kids?</p>
<p begin="00:44:18.319" end="00:44:22.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait, I really don&#39;t remember. Tell me.</p>
<p begin="00:44:25.280" end="00:44:29.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why are there two? [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:44:27.599" end="00:44:31.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Happy birthday. I made this one. I</p>
<p begin="00:44:29.599" end="00:44:34.040" style="s2">bought the other in case you didn&#39;t like</p>
<p begin="00:44:31.040" end="00:44:34.040" style="s2">mine.</p>
<p begin="00:44:35.599" end="00:44:39.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How much did you spend? It&#39;s a gift. You</p>
<p begin="00:44:37.520" end="00:44:40.880" style="s2">don&#39;t pay me back for gifts.</p>
<p begin="00:44:39.760" end="00:44:43.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you. [sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:44:40.880" end="00:44:49.000" style="s2">Can I ask for one more gift?</p>
<p begin="00:44:43.680" end="00:44:49.000" style="s2">You spend today with me. A real date.</p>
<p begin="00:44:49.520" end="00:44:53.445" style="s2">Wait out here. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:45:03.520" end="00:45:07.856" style="s2">You look beautiful.</p>
<p begin="00:45:05.836" end="00:45:07.856" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:45:15.006" end="00:45:17.026" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:45:19.760" end="00:45:23.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why would you throw it away?</p>
<p begin="00:45:25.359" end="00:45:29.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I only need one scarf.</p>
<p begin="00:45:28.160" end="00:45:31.920" style="s2">The one my girlfriend made with her own</p>
<p begin="00:45:29.760" end="00:45:35.119" style="s2">hands.</p>
<p begin="00:45:31.920" end="00:45:38.079" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You kept it inside your coat.</p>
<p begin="00:45:35.119" end="00:45:40.800" style="s2">It&#39;s warm.</p>
<p begin="00:45:38.079" end="00:45:43.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re cold, too. Come here. We can</p>
<p begin="00:45:40.800" end="00:45:43.800" style="s2">share.</p>
<p begin="00:45:49.066" end="00:45:52.400" style="s2">[clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:45:49.760" end="00:45:56.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Aren&#39;t we in the wrong seats?</p>
<p begin="00:45:52.400" end="00:45:56.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re still my assistant.</p>
<p begin="00:46:01.119" end="00:46:05.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is a date. I can&#39;t pedal with you</p>
<p begin="00:46:02.800" end="00:46:05.839" style="s2">back there.</p>
<p begin="00:46:07.200" end="00:46:13.359" style="s2">Fine. My turn.</p>
<p begin="00:46:10.079" end="00:46:16.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:46:13.359" end="00:46:19.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everyone&#39;s staring. Can we just walk?</p>
<p begin="00:46:16.560" end="00:46:19.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right.</p>
<p begin="00:46:20.560" end="00:46:24.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There he is.</p>
<p begin="00:46:31.040" end="00:46:36.282" style="s2">&gt;&gt; ETHAN, WHERE ARE YOU?</p>
<p begin="00:46:34.262" end="00:46:36.282" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [crying and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:46:40.319" end="00:46:43.319" style="s2">&gt;&gt; ETHAN,</p>
<p begin="00:46:46.480" end="00:46:51.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; where were you?</p>
<p begin="00:46:49.599" end="00:46:54.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was right here.</p>
<p begin="00:46:51.520" end="00:46:58.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re filming. Please clear the shot.</p>
<p begin="00:46:54.720" end="00:46:58.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sorry, we didn&#39;t realize.</p>
<p begin="00:47:00.000" end="00:47:03.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ever acted? Interested in auditioning</p>
<p begin="00:47:01.920" end="00:47:07.640" style="s2">for a part?</p>
<p begin="00:47:03.440" end="00:47:07.640" style="s2">No thanks. Not interested.</p>
<p begin="00:47:09.119" end="00:47:16.837" style="s2">&gt;&gt; AT LEAST TAKE MY NUMBER.</p>
<p begin="00:47:11.920" end="00:47:18.079" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My legs are done. Give me a hand.</p>
<p begin="00:47:16.837" end="00:47:21.440" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:47:18.079" end="00:47:23.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where to next? [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:47:21.440" end="00:47:27.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can we take a picture together? Put me</p>
<p begin="00:47:23.920" end="00:47:27.800" style="s2">down before everyone stares.</p>
<p begin="00:47:52.480" end="00:47:59.319" style="s2">your phone. It could be important.</p>
<p begin="00:47:55.920" end="00:47:59.319" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You get it.</p>
<p begin="00:47:59.920" end="00:48:03.200" style="s2">Hello.</p>
<p begin="00:48:00.720" end="00:48:04.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where&#39;s the birthday boy?</p>
<p begin="00:48:03.200" end="00:48:07.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;ve still got a ROOM FULL OF GUESTS</p>
<p begin="00:48:04.640" end="00:48:11.203" style="s2">waiting for him. [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:48:07.680" end="00:48:13.223" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He went to get food.</p>
<p begin="00:48:11.203" end="00:48:13.223" style="s2">[sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:48:13.599" end="00:48:19.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m waiting in the park,</p>
<p begin="00:48:15.520" end="00:48:19.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; right? Is he coming back?</p>
<p begin="00:48:22.160" end="00:48:26.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not today. I&#39;m sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:48:27.578" end="00:48:29.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:48:28.400" end="00:48:31.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where&#39;s Ethan? I haven&#39;t given him his</p>
<p begin="00:48:29.920" end="00:48:32.079" style="s2">gift. I barely see him anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:48:31.520" end="00:48:35.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t know.</p>
<p begin="00:48:32.079" end="00:48:35.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Weren&#39;t you just calling him?</p>
<p begin="00:48:36.960" end="00:48:43.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop waiting. You&#39;re not right for each</p>
<p begin="00:48:39.280" end="00:48:45.440" style="s2">other. Let him go. You can&#39;t force this.</p>
<p begin="00:48:43.920" end="00:48:45.920" style="s2">Our family business doesn&#39;t need this</p>
<p begin="00:48:45.440" end="00:48:47.440" style="s2">marriage.</p>
<p begin="00:48:45.920" end="00:48:48.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We grew up together. Nobody knows him</p>
<p begin="00:48:47.440" end="00:48:52.319" style="s2">like I do.</p>
<p begin="00:48:48.559" end="00:48:56.359" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then why does he keep his distance?</p>
<p begin="00:48:52.319" end="00:48:56.359" style="s2">Find someone who wants you back.</p>
<p begin="00:48:58.400" end="00:49:05.319" style="s2">Let him have his fun. He&#39;ll come back to</p>
<p begin="00:49:00.880" end="00:49:05.319" style="s2">me. That&#39;s all that matters.</p>
<p begin="00:49:06.720" end="00:49:10.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s help each other.</p>
<p begin="00:49:11.200" end="00:49:14.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You want Ethan? I want Alex. Why not</p>
<p begin="00:49:13.119" end="00:49:18.000" style="s2">work together?</p>
<p begin="00:49:14.880" end="00:49:20.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Even you like him?</p>
<p begin="00:49:18.000" end="00:49:22.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Will you help me?</p>
<p begin="00:49:20.240" end="00:49:24.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, but I want a plan.</p>
<p begin="00:49:22.880" end="00:49:27.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m here to see Ethan. Could we speak</p>
<p begin="00:49:24.640" end="00:49:27.640" style="s2">privately?</p>
<p begin="00:49:33.040" end="00:49:39.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Have you heard the campus rumors? They</p>
<p begin="00:49:34.800" end="00:49:39.000" style="s2">say Ethan&#39;s dating his male assistant.</p>
<p begin="00:49:39.680" end="00:49:42.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;ve always wanted you for Ethan. Don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:49:41.200" end="00:49:46.119" style="s2">let gossip upset you.</p>
<p begin="00:49:42.559" end="00:49:46.119" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you, Mr. Sterling.</p>
<p begin="00:49:50.720" end="00:49:55.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s done. Your turn.</p>
<p begin="00:49:57.599" end="00:50:01.920" style="s2">Bring Ethan home now with Alex.</p>
<p begin="00:50:00.079" end="00:50:06.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, he comes alone.</p>
<p begin="00:50:01.920" end="00:50:08.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your father wants you home. Alone.</p>
<p begin="00:50:06.480" end="00:50:10.079" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait here.</p>
<p begin="00:50:08.880" end="00:50:13.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s wrong?</p>
<p begin="00:50:10.079" end="00:50:13.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll be back soon.</p>
<p begin="00:50:18.240" end="00:50:20.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You and your assistant explain the</p>
<p begin="00:50:20.240" end="00:50:24.169" style="s2">rumors.</p>
<p begin="00:50:20.960" end="00:50:25.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;re rumors. Why take them seriously?</p>
<p begin="00:50:24.169" end="00:50:28.760" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:50:25.200" end="00:50:28.760" style="s2">Meet these women.</p>
<p begin="00:50:30.640" end="00:50:36.079" style="s2">Just coffee. Potential wives.</p>
<p begin="00:50:34.480" end="00:50:38.720" style="s2">The right marriage would help you run</p>
<p begin="00:50:36.079" end="00:50:41.040" style="s2">the business.</p>
<p begin="00:50:38.720" end="00:50:43.440" style="s2">What about Lena?</p>
<p begin="00:50:41.040" end="00:50:46.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Always have options.</p>
<p begin="00:50:43.440" end="00:50:49.720" style="s2">Lena brought me the gossip. She&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:50:46.160" end="00:50:49.720" style="s2">looking out for herself.</p>
<p begin="00:50:50.960" end="00:50:56.839" style="s2">I&#39;ll talk, but I decide who I see and</p>
<p begin="00:50:53.839" end="00:50:56.839" style="s2">when.</p>
<p begin="00:51:00.559" end="00:51:05.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m waiting for you in our room.</p>
<p begin="00:51:02.720" end="00:51:07.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s Cole.</p>
<p begin="00:51:05.680" end="00:51:10.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you want?</p>
<p begin="00:51:07.920" end="00:51:14.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;d rather talk in person.</p>
<p begin="00:51:10.720" end="00:51:14.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can you open the door?</p>
<p begin="00:51:16.240" end="00:51:20.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not opening the door.</p>
<p begin="00:51:22.079" end="00:51:26.040" style="s2">We can talk on the phone.</p>
<p begin="00:51:26.079" end="00:51:31.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you hate me that much?</p>
<p begin="00:51:28.400" end="00:51:33.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t feel that way about you.</p>
<p begin="00:51:31.680" end="00:51:36.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why?</p>
<p begin="00:51:33.040" end="00:51:40.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because I love Ethan. I</p>
<p begin="00:51:36.640" end="00:51:40.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can&#39;t explain it, can you?</p>
<p begin="00:51:43.040" end="00:51:50.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He was the first person you got close</p>
<p begin="00:51:44.720" end="00:51:50.200" style="s2">to. What if I&#39;d been first? Would</p>
<p begin="00:51:52.000" end="00:51:59.160" style="s2">you love me instead?</p>
<p begin="00:51:54.800" end="00:51:59.160" style="s2">Remember anything about us as kids?</p>
<p begin="00:52:00.400" end="00:52:06.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. I can&#39;t just take your word for it.</p>
<p begin="00:52:04.079" end="00:52:10.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Will you hear me out sometime?</p>
<p begin="00:52:06.960" end="00:52:15.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll listen. I&#39;ll decide what I believe.</p>
<p begin="00:52:10.960" end="00:52:15.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That doesn&#39;t mean I&#39;ll date you.</p>
<p begin="00:52:22.480" end="00:52:28.240" style="s2">Can I ask something?</p>
<p begin="00:52:25.839" end="00:52:30.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t get mad.</p>
<p begin="00:52:28.240" end="00:52:34.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ask. [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:52:30.960" end="00:52:37.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dinner, dates, being close. Is that what</p>
<p begin="00:52:34.240" end="00:52:37.720" style="s2">makes this love?</p>
<p begin="00:52:45.040" end="00:52:51.839" style="s2">You want a definition?</p>
<p begin="00:52:48.240" end="00:52:54.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I want an answer.</p>
<p begin="00:52:51.839" end="00:52:57.599" style="s2">I don&#39;t know either.</p>
<p begin="00:52:54.400" end="00:53:00.319" style="s2">I feel safe with you.</p>
<p begin="00:52:57.599" end="00:53:03.280" style="s2">I want you close.</p>
<p begin="00:53:00.319" end="00:53:06.000" style="s2">We&#39;ll figure it out together.</p>
<p begin="00:53:03.280" end="00:53:10.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why did your dad call you home?</p>
<p begin="00:53:06.000" end="00:53:10.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s setting me up on dates.</p>
<p begin="00:53:12.319" end="00:53:18.000" style="s2">He heard the rumors.</p>
<p begin="00:53:15.280" end="00:53:21.119" style="s2">Let&#39;s tell everyone you&#39;re a woman,</p>
<p begin="00:53:18.000" end="00:53:24.000" style="s2">that we&#39;re together.</p>
<p begin="00:53:21.119" end="00:53:27.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I lied to get this job.</p>
<p begin="00:53:24.000" end="00:53:30.400" style="s2">Your dad could think I planned all this.</p>
<p begin="00:53:27.520" end="00:53:34.200" style="s2">I&#39;m not from your world.</p>
<p begin="00:53:30.400" end="00:53:34.200" style="s2">I still owe you money.</p>
<p begin="00:53:38.707" end="00:53:41.382" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:53:39.362" end="00:53:41.382" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:53:41.680" end="00:53:46.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You get to say you&#39;re in love. I have to</p>
<p begin="00:53:44.079" end="00:53:49.920" style="s2">explain why I live here.</p>
<p begin="00:53:46.400" end="00:53:51.839" style="s2">I&#39;m not saying never, just not yet.</p>
<p begin="00:53:49.920" end="00:53:57.079" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then we wait. Once I&#39;m independent, we</p>
<p begin="00:53:51.839" end="00:53:57.079" style="s2">tell them together. Dad gave me these.</p>
<p begin="00:54:05.520" end="00:54:11.119" style="s2">They&#39;re all wealthy,</p>
<p begin="00:54:08.319" end="00:54:14.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; CEOs, daughters,</p>
<p begin="00:54:11.119" end="00:54:17.559" style="s2">board members, families,</p>
<p begin="00:54:14.240" end="00:54:17.559" style="s2">good connections.</p>
<p begin="00:54:18.319" end="00:54:22.960" style="s2">She&#39;s gorgeous.</p>
<p begin="00:54:20.800" end="00:54:27.079" style="s2">Great figure, too.</p>
<p begin="00:54:22.960" end="00:54:27.079" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re saying this to your girlfriend?</p>
<p begin="00:54:27.520" end="00:54:32.417" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jealous?</p>
<p begin="00:54:30.240" end="00:54:36.680" style="s2">Take this seriously.</p>
<p begin="00:54:32.417" end="00:54:36.680" style="s2">[sighs] I&#39;m trying to talk to you.</p>
<p begin="00:54:36.800" end="00:54:41.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re learning</p>
<p begin="00:54:38.960" end="00:54:42.640" style="s2">together, remember?</p>
<p begin="00:54:41.040" end="00:54:45.599" style="s2">And I&#39;ll take these dates seriously,</p>
<p begin="00:54:42.640" end="00:54:47.920" style="s2">too.</p>
<p begin="00:54:45.599" end="00:54:52.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m your girlfriend.</p>
<p begin="00:54:47.920" end="00:54:52.200" style="s2">Why are you shopping for another one?</p>
<p begin="00:54:54.960" end="00:54:59.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The meeting&#39;s arranged. I&#39;ll send you</p>
<p begin="00:54:57.200" end="00:55:02.920" style="s2">the time and place.</p>
<p begin="00:54:59.440" end="00:55:02.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll be there.</p>
<p begin="00:55:02.960" end="00:55:07.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Put on your uniform. You&#39;re coming with</p>
<p begin="00:55:04.720" end="00:55:11.280" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="00:55:07.599" end="00:55:14.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re taking me on your date?</p>
<p begin="00:55:11.280" end="00:55:14.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m Grace Whitmore.</p>
<p begin="00:55:17.359" end="00:55:23.119" style="s2">&gt;&gt; May I call you Ethan? [music]</p>
<p begin="00:55:20.559" end="00:55:25.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sure.</p>
<p begin="00:55:23.119" end="00:55:28.319" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you like doing?</p>
<p begin="00:55:25.920" end="00:55:32.520" style="s2">Reading.</p>
<p begin="00:55:28.319" end="00:55:32.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Me too. What do you read?</p>
<p begin="00:55:32.640" end="00:55:36.008" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A bit of everything. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:55:37.839" end="00:55:42.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you interested in art?</p>
<p begin="00:55:40.538" end="00:55:43.920" style="s2">[cough]</p>
<p begin="00:55:42.480" end="00:55:45.359" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Slow down. The water isn&#39;t going</p>
<p begin="00:55:43.920" end="00:55:48.760" style="s2">anywhere. [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:55:45.359" end="00:55:48.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was thirsty.</p>
<p begin="00:55:49.760" end="00:55:55.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you okay now?</p>
<p begin="00:55:52.960" end="00:55:58.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Could you listen to me for a second?</p>
<p begin="00:55:55.920" end="00:56:02.079" style="s2">Would you like to see a movie?</p>
<p begin="00:55:58.799" end="00:56:04.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you want to?</p>
<p begin="00:56:02.079" end="00:56:05.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:56:04.000" end="00:56:08.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then let&#39;s all go</p>
<p begin="00:56:05.520" end="00:56:08.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; get our things.</p>
<p begin="00:56:09.440" end="00:56:13.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s like that with everyone. He drives</p>
<p begin="00:56:11.200" end="00:56:15.359" style="s2">me crazy, too.</p>
<p begin="00:56:13.040" end="00:56:17.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You know him well. I&#39;m his assistant.</p>
<p begin="00:56:15.359" end="00:56:21.079" style="s2">Come on. He hates waiting.</p>
<p begin="00:56:17.680" end="00:56:21.079" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s your name?</p>
<p begin="00:56:28.720" end="00:56:32.000" style="s2">I&#39;m glad you&#39;re coming with us. This is</p>
<p begin="00:56:30.720" end="00:56:34.000" style="s2">much more fun than sitting at that</p>
<p begin="00:56:32.000" end="00:56:36.880" style="s2">table. I hope you weren&#39;t too</p>
<p begin="00:56:34.000" end="00:56:39.489" style="s2">uncomfortable back there.</p>
<p begin="00:56:36.880" end="00:56:41.509" style="s2">Not anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:56:39.489" end="00:56:41.509" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:56:44.960" end="00:56:49.599" style="s2">What would you both like to see? How</p>
<p begin="00:56:47.520" end="00:56:52.640" style="s2">about this romance? We could all use a</p>
<p begin="00:56:49.599" end="00:56:52.640" style="s2">happy ending.</p>
<p begin="00:56:53.680" end="00:56:58.440" style="s2">Okay, I&#39;ll get three seats together.</p>
<p begin="00:57:02.720" end="00:57:06.319" style="s2">&gt;&gt; First time at a movie theater.</p>
<p begin="00:57:04.319" end="00:57:07.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah, I could never justify spending the</p>
<p begin="00:57:06.319" end="00:57:10.760" style="s2">money. There was always something else</p>
<p begin="00:57:07.440" end="00:57:10.760" style="s2">to pay for.</p>
<p begin="00:57:23.119" end="00:57:29.720" style="s2">Please let go of my hand.</p>
<p begin="00:57:25.680" end="00:57:29.720" style="s2">You have such a nice voice.</p>
<p begin="00:57:31.599" end="00:57:35.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not comfortable with this.</p>
<p begin="00:57:35.839" end="00:57:44.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t do this either.</p>
<p begin="00:57:39.359" end="00:57:44.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grace, give him some space.</p>
<p begin="00:57:47.280" end="00:57:51.240" style="s2">I&#39;m already seeing someone.</p>
<p begin="00:57:52.559" end="00:57:57.000" style="s2">That&#39;s okay. I don&#39;t mind.</p>
<p begin="00:57:57.040" end="00:58:01.680" style="s2">I do. I&#39;m not looking for another</p>
<p begin="00:57:59.359" end="00:58:04.480" style="s2">relationship.</p>
<p begin="00:58:01.680" end="00:58:06.400" style="s2">People break up.</p>
<p begin="00:58:04.480" end="00:58:07.839" style="s2">Get to know me. You might change your</p>
<p begin="00:58:06.400" end="00:58:09.119" style="s2">mind.</p>
<p begin="00:58:07.839" end="00:58:12.119" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you trying to do with my</p>
<p begin="00:58:09.119" end="00:58:12.119" style="s2">assistant?</p>
<p begin="00:58:13.200" end="00:58:17.280" style="s2">He&#39;s your assistant.</p>
<p begin="00:58:15.680" end="00:58:20.280" style="s2">Why do you get to decide who he talks</p>
<p begin="00:58:17.280" end="00:58:20.280" style="s2">to?</p>
<p begin="00:58:27.520" end="00:58:32.119" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Keep your voices down, please.</p>
<p begin="00:58:35.599" end="00:58:38.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Could you keep it down? We&#39;re trying to</p>
<p begin="00:58:37.200" end="00:58:41.280" style="s2">watch.</p>
<p begin="00:58:38.640" end="00:58:43.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:58:41.280" end="00:58:46.200" style="s2">Enough. Can I please just watch the</p>
<p begin="00:58:43.200" end="00:58:46.200" style="s2">movie?</p>
<p begin="00:59:05.680" end="00:59:09.200" style="s2">Did you like it?</p>
<p begin="00:59:07.760" end="00:59:12.160" style="s2">That kiss when they finally find each</p>
<p begin="00:59:09.200" end="00:59:14.559" style="s2">other. I love that.</p>
<p begin="00:59:12.160" end="00:59:17.680" style="s2">Me, too. Want to get a drink and talk</p>
<p begin="00:59:14.559" end="00:59:20.079" style="s2">about it?</p>
<p begin="00:59:17.680" end="00:59:23.119" style="s2">Thank you. But I&#39;m working. When&#39;s your</p>
<p begin="00:59:20.079" end="00:59:26.400" style="s2">day off? I can&#39;t make plans with you.</p>
<p begin="00:59:23.119" end="00:59:28.480" style="s2">Please don&#39;t wait for me. Then quit.</p>
<p begin="00:59:26.400" end="00:59:31.799" style="s2">I&#39;ll hire you. We could be together</p>
<p begin="00:59:28.480" end="00:59:31.799" style="s2">every day.</p>
<p begin="00:59:48.000" end="00:59:54.880" style="s2">I&#39;m keeping my job and I don&#39;t want to</p>
<p begin="00:59:50.559" end="00:59:57.920" style="s2">date you. We just met.</p>
<p begin="00:59:54.880" end="01:00:00.480" style="s2">Can I still see you? If we run into each</p>
<p begin="00:59:57.920" end="01:00:04.160" style="s2">other, we can say hello.</p>
<p begin="01:00:00.480" end="01:00:07.480" style="s2">Can I have your number?</p>
<p begin="01:00:04.160" end="01:00:07.480" style="s2">We&#39;re leaving.</p>
<p begin="01:00:16.720" end="01:00:21.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You know she likes you. Why keep smiling</p>
<p begin="01:00:19.599" end="01:00:24.559" style="s2">at her?</p>
<p begin="01:00:21.839" end="01:00:26.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re jealous. I already turned her</p>
<p begin="01:00:24.559" end="01:00:30.599" style="s2">down.</p>
<p begin="01:00:26.240" end="01:00:30.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You keep giving people the wrong idea.</p>
<p begin="01:00:33.981" end="01:00:36.001" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="01:00:37.119" end="01:00:43.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why did you hit me?</p>
<p begin="01:00:39.839" end="01:00:43.799" style="s2">Stop letting them get close.</p>
<p begin="01:00:44.240" end="01:00:49.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look only at me. Think only about me.</p>
<p begin="01:00:47.760" end="01:00:51.440" style="s2">You don&#39;t smile at anyone else unless I</p>
<p begin="01:00:49.440" end="01:00:54.079" style="s2">say so.</p>
<p begin="01:00:51.440" end="01:00:55.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m my own person. You don&#39;t get to tell</p>
<p begin="01:00:54.079" end="01:00:59.582" style="s2">me who I can smile at.</p>
<p begin="01:00:55.760" end="01:00:59.582" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why won&#39;t you listen to me? [music]</p>
<p begin="01:01:02.160" end="01:01:08.960" style="s2">Not scared of making me angry anymore.</p>
<p begin="01:01:06.480" end="01:01:10.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I get to have friends. I get to have a</p>
<p begin="01:01:08.960" end="01:01:11.839" style="s2">life.</p>
<p begin="01:01:10.240" end="01:01:12.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You won&#39;t do it. Are you planning to</p>
<p begin="01:01:11.839" end="01:01:17.160" style="s2">betray me?</p>
<p begin="01:01:12.400" end="01:01:17.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ethan, stop. I&#39;m not your mother.</p>
<p begin="01:01:18.319" end="01:01:21.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Finish that sentence and I swear I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="01:01:20.240" end="01:01:25.000" style="s2">kill you.</p>
<p begin="01:01:21.440" end="01:01:25.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let go of me.</p>
<p begin="01:01:26.382" end="01:01:28.402" style="s2">[cough]</p>
<p begin="01:01:29.440" end="01:01:34.297" style="s2">You know, not to bring up my mother.</p>
<p begin="01:01:32.277" end="01:01:34.297" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="01:01:37.520" end="01:01:42.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Being hurt doesn&#39;t give you the right to</p>
<p begin="01:01:39.200" end="01:01:42.440" style="s2">hurt me.</p>
<p begin="01:01:43.040" end="01:01:47.400" style="s2">We go back to being boss and assistant.</p>
<p begin="01:01:48.559" end="01:01:54.319" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you saying?</p>
<p begin="01:01:50.960" end="01:01:57.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re breaking up. I&#39;ll do my job. I</p>
<p begin="01:01:54.319" end="01:01:57.760" style="s2">won&#39;t be your girlfriend.</p>
<p begin="01:02:05.440" end="01:02:10.400" style="s2">You&#39;re really ending this?</p>
<p begin="01:02:08.240" end="01:02:12.319" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="01:02:10.400" end="01:02:15.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How do I fix this?</p>
<p begin="01:02:12.319" end="01:02:15.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let me leave first.</p>
<p begin="01:02:21.680" end="01:02:29.119" style="s2">We need boundaries in writing.</p>
<p begin="01:02:26.000" end="01:02:32.119" style="s2">Unlock the door. I just want to talk in</p>
<p begin="01:02:29.119" end="01:02:32.119" style="s2">private.</p>
<p begin="01:02:35.680" end="01:02:40.960" style="s2">I hurt you. It wasn&#39;t your fault. I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="01:02:38.480" end="01:02:42.720" style="s2">sorry.</p>
<p begin="01:02:40.960" end="01:02:46.359" style="s2">I heard you. That doesn&#39;t mean I can</p>
<p begin="01:02:42.720" end="01:02:46.359" style="s2">forgive you right now.</p>
<p begin="01:02:51.760" end="01:02:56.760" style="s2">I keep thinking everyone I get close to</p>
<p begin="01:02:53.520" end="01:02:56.760" style="s2">will leave.</p>
<p begin="01:02:57.040" end="01:03:03.319" style="s2">We can talk about how we treat each</p>
<p begin="01:02:58.559" end="01:03:03.319" style="s2">other, not how you control me.</p>
<p begin="01:03:18.388" end="01:03:20.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:03:19.200" end="01:03:22.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What if you go out with someone and</p>
<p begin="01:03:20.799" end="01:03:27.160" style="s2">leave me here?</p>
<p begin="01:03:22.799" end="01:03:27.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Even a boyfriend isn&#39;t my guardian.</p>
<p begin="01:03:27.680" end="01:03:30.160" style="s2">Wear women&#39;s clothes. Grace wouldn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:03:29.359" end="01:03:32.480" style="s2">have chased you.</p>
<p begin="01:03:30.160" end="01:03:35.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We discussed this. Going public affects</p>
<p begin="01:03:32.480" end="01:03:38.039" style="s2">my job. It isn&#39;t a cure for your</p>
<p begin="01:03:35.039" end="01:03:38.039" style="s2">jealousy.</p>
<p begin="01:03:43.680" end="01:03:50.480" style="s2">No threats, no hurting each other. We</p>
<p begin="01:03:46.480" end="01:03:54.359" style="s2">choose our own friends and time alone.</p>
<p begin="01:03:50.480" end="01:03:54.359" style="s2">Ask before touching.</p>
<p begin="01:03:55.200" end="01:03:58.999" style="s2">Trust can&#39;t depend on me never seeing</p>
<p begin="01:03:56.960" end="01:04:01.019" style="s2">anyone else.</p>
<p begin="01:03:58.999" end="01:04:01.019" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:04:05.359" end="01:04:12.200" style="s2">Signing this doesn&#39;t mean we&#39;re back</p>
<p begin="01:04:06.799" end="01:04:12.200" style="s2">together. I need to see you do it.</p>
<p begin="01:04:13.680" end="01:04:17.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can help with that.</p>
<p begin="01:04:18.240" end="01:04:25.079" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m going to the library</p>
<p begin="01:04:21.119" end="01:04:25.079" style="s2">&gt;&gt; by myself today.</p>
<p begin="01:04:43.539" end="01:04:45.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:04:46.240" end="01:04:52.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Want some dinner?</p>
<p begin="01:04:49.280" end="01:04:52.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, thanks.</p>
<p begin="01:04:55.280" end="01:05:00.440" style="s2">want to go over the project.</p>
<p begin="01:04:57.440" end="01:05:00.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sure.</p>
<p begin="01:05:04.720" end="01:05:07.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You always</p>
<p begin="01:05:09.119" end="01:05:15.319" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They seem fine. Was telling his dad</p>
<p begin="01:05:11.680" end="01:05:15.319" style="s2">supposed to change anything?</p>
<p begin="01:05:19.200" end="01:05:23.119" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It doesn&#39;t have to happen overnight.</p>
<p begin="01:05:21.680" end="01:05:25.280" style="s2">We just keep giving them reasons to</p>
<p begin="01:05:23.119" end="01:05:27.119" style="s2">doubt each other.</p>
<p begin="01:05:25.280" end="01:05:29.119" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What now?</p>
<p begin="01:05:27.119" end="01:05:31.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Keep those women around, Ethan. I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="01:05:29.119" end="01:05:35.000" style="s2">handle Alex. Alex is already asking what</p>
<p begin="01:05:31.760" end="01:05:35.000" style="s2">love means.</p>
<p begin="01:05:41.599" end="01:05:44.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can we meet? I want to explain what</p>
<p begin="01:05:43.200" end="01:05:45.359" style="s2">happened when we were kids. Not over the</p>
<p begin="01:05:44.960" end="01:05:47.119" style="s2">phone.</p>
<p begin="01:05:45.359" end="01:05:47.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll hear you out. Only about when we</p>
<p begin="01:05:47.119" end="01:05:51.000" style="s2">were kids.</p>
<p begin="01:05:47.760" end="01:05:51.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m downstairs.</p>
<p begin="01:05:54.160" end="01:05:57.480" style="s2">right here.</p>
<p begin="01:05:58.640" end="01:06:03.440" style="s2">I was six. I got in trouble at home and</p>
<p begin="01:06:01.680" end="01:06:07.039" style="s2">ran off.</p>
<p begin="01:06:03.440" end="01:06:08.960" style="s2">Two adults tried to take me.</p>
<p begin="01:06:07.039" end="01:06:12.280" style="s2">You got them filthy, grabbed my hand,</p>
<p begin="01:06:08.960" end="01:06:12.280" style="s2">and ran.</p>
<p begin="01:06:14.400" end="01:06:21.119" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What did I say afterward?</p>
<p begin="01:06:17.680" end="01:06:24.119" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stay alive. Without your life, you have</p>
<p begin="01:06:21.119" end="01:06:24.119" style="s2">nothing.</p>
<p begin="01:06:25.039" end="01:06:29.705" style="s2">Mom pushed me, but Ethan always did</p>
<p begin="01:06:26.559" end="01:06:29.705" style="s2">better. I was his backup. [music]</p>
<p begin="01:06:32.160" end="01:06:37.000" style="s2">Why do you only care when I talk about</p>
<p begin="01:06:34.000" end="01:06:37.000" style="s2">him?</p>
<p begin="01:06:38.240" end="01:06:41.200" style="s2">If I were the heir, maybe I&#39;d have hired</p>
<p begin="01:06:40.079" end="01:06:43.039" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="01:06:41.200" end="01:06:44.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not a prize for whichever one of you</p>
<p begin="01:06:43.039" end="01:06:45.520" style="s2">wins.</p>
<p begin="01:06:44.240" end="01:06:48.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Work for me.</p>
<p begin="01:06:45.520" end="01:06:49.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Even if I did, you&#39;d be my boss. That</p>
<p begin="01:06:48.000" end="01:06:53.559" style="s2">wouldn&#39;t make me love you. Helping you</p>
<p begin="01:06:49.680" end="01:06:53.559" style="s2">doesn&#39;t mean I owe you love.</p>
<p begin="01:06:57.816" end="01:06:59.836" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="01:07:00.240" end="01:07:05.520" style="s2">Your life can&#39;t revolve around me.</p>
<p begin="01:07:04.400" end="01:07:08.079" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll try,</p>
<p begin="01:07:05.520" end="01:07:10.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; friends, but don&#39;t use our past to ask</p>
<p begin="01:07:08.079" end="01:07:13.480" style="s2">for more.</p>
<p begin="01:07:10.480" end="01:07:13.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="01:07:18.880" end="01:07:24.839" style="s2">Where did you go?</p>
<p begin="01:07:20.640" end="01:07:24.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shopping. Didn&#39;t find anything.</p>
<p begin="01:07:25.440" end="01:07:30.079" style="s2">That was a lie. I met Cole. He told me</p>
<p begin="01:07:28.079" end="01:07:31.760" style="s2">about when we were kids. I&#39;m still</p>
<p begin="01:07:30.079" end="01:07:35.319" style="s2">scared you&#39;ll get angry. It&#39;s why I</p>
<p begin="01:07:31.760" end="01:07:35.319" style="s2">reach for an excuse.</p>
<p begin="01:07:35.680" end="01:07:41.079" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not happy about it. But you didn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:07:37.599" end="01:07:41.079" style="s2">do anything wrong.</p>
<p begin="01:07:41.839" end="01:07:46.079" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He remembers me helping him escape. He</p>
<p begin="01:07:44.079" end="01:07:49.200" style="s2">offered me a job. I said that wouldn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:07:46.079" end="01:07:53.079" style="s2">make me love him. Let&#39;s try again. The</p>
<p begin="01:07:49.200" end="01:07:53.079" style="s2">rules we wrote still stand.</p>
<p begin="01:07:56.240" end="01:08:01.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t forget your projects over winter</p>
<p begin="01:07:58.000" end="01:08:01.000" style="s2">break.</p>
<p begin="01:08:02.319" end="01:08:06.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m going home tomorrow to see my</p>
<p begin="01:08:04.160" end="01:08:08.640" style="s2">parents.</p>
<p begin="01:08:06.720" end="01:08:11.119" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can I come with you?</p>
<p begin="01:08:08.640" end="01:08:14.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My boss and my boyfriend.</p>
<p begin="01:08:11.119" end="01:08:17.279" style="s2">They know about my job, not us.</p>
<p begin="01:08:14.799" end="01:08:18.719" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just say I&#39;m a classmate.</p>
<p begin="01:08:17.279" end="01:08:21.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve never brought a guy home. They&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="01:08:18.719" end="01:08:24.080" style="s2">ask. [music]</p>
<p begin="01:08:21.440" end="01:08:25.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then bring a girl.</p>
<p begin="01:08:24.080" end="01:08:27.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re serious?</p>
<p begin="01:08:25.520" end="01:08:30.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You dress as a guy, I can dress as a</p>
<p begin="01:08:27.600" end="01:08:32.239" style="s2">girl.</p>
<p begin="01:08:30.080" end="01:08:33.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Our place is tiny.</p>
<p begin="01:08:32.239" end="01:08:36.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t mind.</p>
<p begin="01:08:33.839" end="01:08:37.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One day we come back together and no</p>
<p begin="01:08:36.000" end="01:08:40.120" style="s2">telling them we&#39;re dating.</p>
<p begin="01:08:37.120" end="01:08:40.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="01:08:44.480" end="01:08:50.960" style="s2">Ivy, your name is Ivy today.</p>
<p begin="01:08:48.319" end="01:08:54.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ivy,</p>
<p begin="01:08:50.960" end="01:08:54.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; maybe don&#39;t go that high.</p>
<p begin="01:09:04.799" end="01:09:09.839" style="s2">Sweetheart, come in.</p>
<p begin="01:09:08.159" end="01:09:10.719" style="s2">Mom, this is Ivy. We have classes</p>
<p begin="01:09:09.839" end="01:09:14.440" style="s2">together.</p>
<p begin="01:09:10.719" end="01:09:14.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you for having me.</p>
<p begin="01:09:17.332" end="01:09:21.120" style="s2">[gasps and sighs]</p>
<p begin="01:09:18.640" end="01:09:22.719" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s got a sore throat.</p>
<p begin="01:09:21.120" end="01:09:25.960" style="s2">Poor thing. Come sit. I&#39;ll get you some</p>
<p begin="01:09:22.719" end="01:09:25.960" style="s2">warm water.</p>
<p begin="01:09:28.319" end="01:09:32.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you.</p>
<p begin="01:09:30.319" end="01:09:34.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sorry, it&#39;s a bit cramped.</p>
<p begin="01:09:32.400" end="01:09:36.319" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s nice. Really?</p>
<p begin="01:09:34.640" end="01:09:37.679" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She rarely brings friends home. We both</p>
<p begin="01:09:36.319" end="01:09:38.480" style="s2">worked so much. She was always looking</p>
<p begin="01:09:37.679" end="01:09:40.319" style="s2">after herself.</p>
<p begin="01:09:38.480" end="01:09:42.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, I just grew up a little faster.</p>
<p begin="01:09:40.319" end="01:09:44.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let me finish. Once I graduate and start</p>
<p begin="01:09:42.560" end="01:09:46.880" style="s2">earning, I&#39;ll get you a bigger place.</p>
<p begin="01:09:44.799" end="01:09:48.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m making us a proper lunch.</p>
<p begin="01:09:46.880" end="01:09:50.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maybe you should go. You look so out of</p>
<p begin="01:09:48.880" end="01:09:52.000" style="s2">place here.</p>
<p begin="01:09:50.080" end="01:09:55.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Worried about the disguise for letting</p>
<p begin="01:09:52.000" end="01:09:55.159" style="s2">me in.</p>
<p begin="01:09:55.600" end="01:10:01.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You know so much about me. I want to</p>
<p begin="01:09:57.600" end="01:10:01.080" style="s2">know you, too.</p>
<p begin="01:10:02.800" end="01:10:08.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Here&#39;s the kitchen.</p>
<p begin="01:10:05.040" end="01:10:08.040" style="s2">Small,</p>
<p begin="01:10:08.480" end="01:10:12.360" style="s2">but everything fits.</p>
<p begin="01:10:17.360" end="01:10:21.000" style="s2">You can sit here.</p>
<p begin="01:10:26.400" end="01:10:33.719" style="s2">Where did you do your homework?</p>
<p begin="01:10:28.880" end="01:10:33.719" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Right there. It&#39;s always been like this.</p>
<p begin="01:10:38.080" end="01:10:44.920" style="s2">Did you just take a picture?</p>
<p begin="01:10:40.800" end="01:10:44.920" style="s2">I wanted to remember this visit.</p>
<p begin="01:10:48.560" end="01:10:52.800" style="s2">I won&#39;t show anyone. I&#39;ll delete it if</p>
<p begin="01:10:50.800" end="01:10:56.159" style="s2">you want.</p>
<p begin="01:10:52.800" end="01:11:00.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Keep it just for us.</p>
<p begin="01:10:56.159" end="01:11:00.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s wait in the living room for mom.</p>
<p begin="01:11:00.480" end="01:11:05.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did you ever want to leave?</p>
<p begin="01:11:02.719" end="01:11:07.120" style="s2">My family&#39;s here. I want a better life</p>
<p begin="01:11:05.040" end="01:11:08.480" style="s2">for my parent. I don&#39;t want to forget</p>
<p begin="01:11:07.120" end="01:11:11.360" style="s2">this one.</p>
<p begin="01:11:08.480" end="01:11:15.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, sweetheart. You&#39;re home.</p>
<p begin="01:11:11.360" end="01:11:18.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You know her boss. Is he good to her?</p>
<p begin="01:11:15.760" end="01:11:19.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How long have we got you?</p>
<p begin="01:11:18.159" end="01:11:22.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just today, Dad.</p>
<p begin="01:11:19.920" end="01:11:25.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Still glad you&#39;re here. Maybe a gift for</p>
<p begin="01:11:22.800" end="01:11:27.600" style="s2">your boss would help with time off.</p>
<p begin="01:11:25.520" end="01:11:31.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s not why.</p>
<p begin="01:11:27.600" end="01:11:31.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, who&#39;s this?</p>
<p begin="01:11:32.080" end="01:11:36.760" style="s2">Ivy, we have classes together.</p>
<p begin="01:11:37.920" end="01:11:44.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, you&#39;re the host. Sit down.</p>
<p begin="01:11:41.920" end="01:11:46.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;ve had this couch forever.</p>
<p begin="01:11:44.560" end="01:11:50.360" style="s2">It&#39;s fine.</p>
<p begin="01:11:46.800" end="01:11:50.360" style="s2">You know her boss.</p>
<p begin="01:11:50.560" end="01:11:59.199" style="s2">Is he good to her? He takes care of her.</p>
<p begin="01:11:55.280" end="01:12:02.960" style="s2">He&#39;s made mistakes, too.</p>
<p begin="01:11:59.199" end="01:12:06.719" style="s2">When she speaks up, he needs to listen.</p>
<p begin="01:12:02.960" end="01:12:08.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t keep things to yourself. Okay.</p>
<p begin="01:12:06.719" end="01:12:10.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why didn&#39;t you invite him, too?</p>
<p begin="01:12:08.960" end="01:12:12.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s busy.</p>
<p begin="01:12:10.560" end="01:12:14.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Guess someone like him wouldn&#39;t feel at</p>
<p begin="01:12:12.080" end="01:12:18.400" style="s2">home here.</p>
<p begin="01:12:14.800" end="01:12:20.719" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I envy you having a family like that.</p>
<p begin="01:12:18.400" end="01:12:22.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, don&#39;t say that. It has nothing to</p>
<p begin="01:12:20.719" end="01:12:25.199" style="s2">do with our home.</p>
<p begin="01:12:22.080" end="01:12:28.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m really glad I came.</p>
<p begin="01:12:25.199" end="01:12:28.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lunch won&#39;t be long.</p>
<p begin="01:12:38.420" end="01:12:40.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:12:41.920" end="01:12:44.719" style="s2">&gt;&gt; First down to go.</p>
<p begin="01:12:43.199" end="01:12:47.719" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A little more, please.</p>
<p begin="01:12:44.719" end="01:12:47.719" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah.</p>
<p begin="01:12:48.900" end="01:12:50.920" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:12:56.080" end="01:13:01.600" style="s2">Mom spent so much on lunch.</p>
<p begin="01:12:59.760" end="01:13:04.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Want me to cover it?</p>
<p begin="01:13:01.600" end="01:13:06.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They wanted to feed you, not charge you.</p>
<p begin="01:13:04.159" end="01:13:10.719" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I left them some money before we left in</p>
<p begin="01:13:06.480" end="01:13:13.199" style="s2">your name to say thank you.</p>
<p begin="01:13:10.719" end="01:13:15.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ask me first next time.</p>
<p begin="01:13:13.199" end="01:13:18.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I will.</p>
<p begin="01:13:15.600" end="01:13:20.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you.</p>
<p begin="01:13:18.800" end="01:13:24.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I envy you.</p>
<p begin="01:13:20.880" end="01:13:24.840" style="s2">having a family like that.</p>
<p begin="01:13:29.280" end="01:13:34.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ethan, Dad wants you home. He&#39;s really</p>
<p begin="01:13:31.840" end="01:13:37.520" style="s2">angry.</p>
<p begin="01:13:34.000" end="01:13:39.120" style="s2">Dad knows about you, too.</p>
<p begin="01:13:37.520" end="01:13:40.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let me talk to him first. You can wait</p>
<p begin="01:13:39.120" end="01:13:43.280" style="s2">upstairs.</p>
<p begin="01:13:40.800" end="01:13:45.679" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What if he asks about me?</p>
<p begin="01:13:43.280" end="01:13:47.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll explain my choice. You speak for</p>
<p begin="01:13:45.679" end="01:13:50.400" style="s2">yourself.</p>
<p begin="01:13:47.280" end="01:13:53.719" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay. But I won&#39;t hide. You can tell him</p>
<p begin="01:13:50.400" end="01:13:53.719" style="s2">I&#39;m a woman.</p>
<p begin="01:13:58.719" end="01:14:02.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll be here. I&#39;ll come down if I need</p>
<p begin="01:14:00.960" end="01:14:05.280" style="s2">to.</p>
<p begin="01:14:02.960" end="01:14:07.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why embarrass me after I arranged those</p>
<p begin="01:14:05.280" end="01:14:11.040" style="s2">introductions?</p>
<p begin="01:14:07.520" end="01:14:13.840" style="s2">I don&#39;t want to date them.</p>
<p begin="01:14:11.040" end="01:14:17.400" style="s2">Those families are potential partners.</p>
<p begin="01:14:13.840" end="01:14:17.400" style="s2">You&#39;re my heir.</p>
<p begin="01:14:17.760" end="01:14:23.560" style="s2">I&#39;ll do my job. You don&#39;t get to choose</p>
<p begin="01:14:20.320" end="01:14:23.560" style="s2">my wife.</p>
<p begin="01:14:24.800" end="01:14:29.040" style="s2">I hear you&#39;re involved with your</p>
<p begin="01:14:26.320" end="01:14:32.000" style="s2">assistant.</p>
<p begin="01:14:29.040" end="01:14:36.080" style="s2">Is Alex why you keep refusing?</p>
<p begin="01:14:32.000" end="01:14:37.840" style="s2">Yes. I want Alex. No.</p>
<p begin="01:14:36.080" end="01:14:40.320" style="s2">Keeping that assistant around has caused</p>
<p begin="01:14:37.840" end="01:14:45.239" style="s2">enough gossip.</p>
<p begin="01:14:40.320" end="01:14:45.239" style="s2">Alex is a woman. She&#39;s my girlfriend.</p>
<p begin="01:14:51.040" end="01:14:56.159" style="s2">I want your blessing, Dad.</p>
<p begin="01:14:53.760" end="01:14:58.719" style="s2">Not another date.</p>
<p begin="01:14:56.159" end="01:15:00.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She lied to get hired. How do you know</p>
<p begin="01:14:58.719" end="01:15:03.280" style="s2">she isn&#39;t after your money?</p>
<p begin="01:15:00.960" end="01:15:04.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She came for a job. We fell for each</p>
<p begin="01:15:03.280" end="01:15:06.320" style="s2">other later.</p>
<p begin="01:15:04.480" end="01:15:08.239" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The women I chose could help this</p>
<p begin="01:15:06.320" end="01:15:10.239" style="s2">family.</p>
<p begin="01:15:08.239" end="01:15:13.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You married for business. How did that</p>
<p begin="01:15:10.239" end="01:15:13.400" style="s2">work out?</p>
<p begin="01:15:18.880" end="01:15:23.360" style="s2">Watch your tone.</p>
<p begin="01:15:21.040" end="01:15:27.640" style="s2">I&#39;ll do my part.</p>
<p begin="01:15:23.360" end="01:15:27.640" style="s2">My marriage isn&#39;t a business deal.</p>
<p begin="01:15:30.687" end="01:15:34.840" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:15:30.960" end="01:15:34.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ethan, help me.</p>
<p begin="01:15:38.547" end="01:15:40.567" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:15:52.320" end="01:15:56.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chloe, call for medical help.</p>
<p begin="01:15:56.800" end="01:16:00.320" style="s2">First,</p>
<p begin="01:15:58.239" end="01:16:04.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ethan, let me through. Bennett showed me</p>
<p begin="01:16:00.320" end="01:16:04.280" style="s2">where the medication records are.</p>
<p begin="01:16:34.960" end="01:16:39.840" style="s2">Thank you.</p>
<p begin="01:16:37.520" end="01:16:42.239" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I just wanted to help.</p>
<p begin="01:16:39.840" end="01:16:45.679" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re Alex.</p>
<p begin="01:16:42.239" end="01:16:48.640" style="s2">Why pretend to be a man for this job?</p>
<p begin="01:16:45.679" end="01:16:53.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It paid well.</p>
<p begin="01:16:48.640" end="01:16:53.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, you&#39;re with my son for his money.</p>
<p begin="01:16:53.440" end="01:16:57.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, I did a job and earned my pay.</p>
<p begin="01:16:56.159" end="01:17:00.159" style="s2">Becoming his girlfriend came later. That</p>
<p begin="01:16:57.840" end="01:17:02.960" style="s2">wasn&#39;t for money.</p>
<p begin="01:17:00.159" end="01:17:05.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Aren&#39;t you afraid of upsetting me?</p>
<p begin="01:17:02.960" end="01:17:06.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, but I won&#39;t admit to something I</p>
<p begin="01:17:05.280" end="01:17:09.520" style="s2">didn&#39;t do.</p>
<p begin="01:17:06.159" end="01:17:12.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You lied. I can&#39;t trust you. You don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:17:09.520" end="01:17:15.120" style="s2">belong in this family.</p>
<p begin="01:17:12.560" end="01:17:18.239" style="s2">That&#39;s enough, Dad.</p>
<p begin="01:17:15.120" end="01:17:20.480" style="s2">She&#39;s the one I want.</p>
<p begin="01:17:18.239" end="01:17:22.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I trusted the wrong person. You&#39;re too</p>
<p begin="01:17:20.480" end="01:17:26.360" style="s2">young to understand.</p>
<p begin="01:17:22.800" end="01:17:26.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I trust Alex.</p>
<p begin="01:17:28.480" end="01:17:33.199" style="s2">I lied to get the job. I&#39;ll take</p>
<p begin="01:17:30.719" end="01:17:37.800" style="s2">responsibility for that. But I earned my</p>
<p begin="01:17:33.199" end="01:17:37.800" style="s2">pay and I chose him.</p>
<p begin="01:17:45.520" end="01:17:51.560" style="s2">All right. If you&#39;re sure, treat each</p>
<p begin="01:17:47.760" end="01:17:51.560" style="s2">other well. Go on,</p>
<p begin="01:17:57.760" end="01:18:04.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chloe. You and Nate,</p>
<p begin="01:18:01.920" end="01:18:08.560" style="s2">we&#39;re together. I chose him. It has</p>
<p begin="01:18:04.880" end="01:18:08.560" style="s2">nothing to do with business.</p>
<p begin="01:18:08.719" end="01:18:12.920" style="s2">What matters is that you&#39;re happy.</p>
<p begin="01:18:20.640" end="01:18:24.719" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do I still have to be your assistant to</p>
<p begin="01:18:22.320" end="01:18:28.280" style="s2">stay with you?</p>
<p begin="01:18:24.719" end="01:18:28.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You mean the job?</p>
<p begin="01:18:28.960" end="01:18:34.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I want to quit.</p>
<p begin="01:18:32.000" end="01:18:36.400" style="s2">I&#39;m not leaving you.</p>
<p begin="01:18:34.320" end="01:18:38.159" style="s2">I want to be here as your girlfriend.</p>
<p begin="01:18:36.400" end="01:18:41.120" style="s2">I&#39;ll get a part-time job and keep paying</p>
<p begin="01:18:38.159" end="01:18:43.440" style="s2">back the loan.</p>
<p begin="01:18:41.120" end="01:18:44.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay, we&#39;ll end the contract. No penalty</p>
<p begin="01:18:43.440" end="01:18:47.040" style="s2">for quitting. We&#39;ll make a separate</p>
<p begin="01:18:44.480" end="01:18:52.120" style="s2">repayment plan that works for you. We</p>
<p begin="01:18:47.040" end="01:18:52.120" style="s2">still get dates, right? If I&#39;m free,</p>
<p begin="01:19:01.840" end="01:19:04.840" style="s2">Alex,</p>
<p begin="01:19:05.679" end="01:19:09.000" style="s2">it&#39;s me.</p>
<p begin="01:19:14.000" end="01:19:18.520" style="s2">Every time I take you out, your</p>
<p begin="01:19:15.199" end="01:19:18.520" style="s2">brother&#39;s here.</p>
<p begin="01:19:20.320" end="01:19:25.360" style="s2">When are you free?</p>
<p begin="01:19:23.280" end="01:19:29.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 10 more minutes.</p>
<p begin="01:19:25.360" end="01:19:29.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay, I&#39;ll wait.</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
